(1540492, 202730, 31230, '<td valign="top">I agree with you.  That is how I saw this challenge, freedom to shoot whatever I wanted.  I like this image and your angle, but maybe bumping up the contrast just a little would have given it that little extra.</td>', 'I agree with you.  That is how I saw this challenge, freedom to shoot whatever I wanted.  I like this image and your angle, but maybe bumping up the contrast just a little would have given it that little extra.', '2005-07-17 08:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
