(1540533, 203336, 34906, '<td valign="top">A celebrity shot!  For the first time, I really can appreciate the mass of his chin.<br/>Good contemplative portrait.  (If this isn''t really Leno, I take it all back)</td>', 'A celebrity shot!  For the first time, I really can appreciate the mass of his chin.Good contemplative portrait.  (If this isn''t really Leno, I take it all back)', '2005-07-17 08:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
