(1540538, 204614, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good leading lines here, sky is a bit overexposed.  Overall, colors seem a bit flat but still a good shot.</td>', 'Good leading lines here, sky is a bit overexposed.  Overall, colors seem a bit flat but still a good shot.', '2005-07-17 08:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
