(1540547, 204527, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Crop seems a little tight - the top plane doens''t have a lot of room.  It''s great that the subjects are coming inot the frame - creates lots of visual interest.  Good job with te color of the sky - this is really quite nice.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Crop seems a little tight - the top plane doens''t have a lot of room.  It''s great that the subjects are coming inot the frame - creates lots of visual interest.  Good job with te color of the sky - this is really quite nice.', '2005-07-17 08:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540548, 204079, 20066, '<td valign="top">I think too much contrast and it is difficoult to find the point of interest in the photo.</td>', 'I think too much contrast and it is difficoult to find the point of interest in the photo.', '2005-07-17 08:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540549, 204797, 34906, '<td valign="top">Gets ya thinking....</td>', 'Gets ya thinking....', '2005-07-17 08:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
