(1540589, 204776, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The crop feels really tight, and there is a lot of negative space in the middle of the frame.  This shot might have been improved if the waves were closer to the footprints, or if the reflection on the sane in the middle was a little stronger.  Overall, a decent image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The crop feels really tight, and there is a lot of negative space in the middle of the frame.  This shot might have been improved if the waves were closer to the footprints, or if the reflection on the sane in the middle was a little stronger.  Overall, a decent image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-07-17 09:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540590, 203950, 34906, '<td valign="top">Excellent negative space.</td>', 'Excellent negative space.', '2005-07-17 09:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
