(1540596, 204882, 29009, '<td valign="top">This was a creative idea.  Good use of DOF.  With regard to composition, I would have removed that brown lump of something - it doesn''t add much and I''m not sure what it''s supposed to be or represent (sorry).  I might have gone with either the house or the figure, but the figure being larger than the house seems off to me.  Lighting and focus are good.  Overall, this is a decent image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This was a creative idea.  Good use of DOF.  With regard to composition, I would have removed that brown lump of something - it doesn''t add much and I''m not sure what it''s supposed to be or represent (sorry).  I might have gone with either the house or the figure, but the figure being larger than the house seems off to me.  Lighting and focus are good.  Overall, this is a decent image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-07-17 09:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
