(1540841, 204078, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful BEAUTIFUL photo!!!    Those birds are so hard to capture since they rarely sit still long enoughto get them.   I love the black background.</td>', 'Beautiful BEAUTIFUL photo!!!    Those birds are so hard to capture since they rarely sit still long enoughto get them.   I love the black background.', '2005-07-17 11:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540843, 204888, 2764, '<td valign="top">eekkk - get off the road.  maybe you could have included something else in the picture to show the concept rather than relying on the title?  a birthday hat, drivers liscence, Also the paint brush strokes on the right are distracting, does the right side contribute to the image or could it be cropped?</td>', 'eekkk - get off the road.  maybe you could have included something else in the picture to show the concept rather than relying on the title?  a birthday hat, drivers liscence, Also the paint brush strokes on the right are distracting, does the right side contribute to the image or could it be cropped?', '2005-07-17 11:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540844, 203767, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oh cute baby - great pic. when the challenge is over, go back and darken his eye - its the same color as the water and makes me feel like Im looking through his head.</td>', 'Oh cute baby - great pic. when the challenge is over, go back and darken his eye - its the same color as the water and makes me feel like Im looking through his head.', '2005-07-17 11:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
