(1540877, 204800, 30214, '<td valign="top">the idea is good, but the lighting is a bit dull</td>', 'the idea is good, but the lighting is a bit dull', '2005-07-17 12:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540881, 203735, 30214, '<td valign="top">great photo. I love the composition and the retro feel. My favorite so far</td>', 'great photo. I love the composition and the retro feel. My favorite so far', '2005-07-17 12:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540885, 204028, 30214, '<td valign="top">great idea!</td>', 'great idea!', '2005-07-17 12:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540887, 202167, 30214, '<td valign="top">great idea. Not sure about small DOF</td>', 'great idea. Not sure about small DOF', '2005-07-17 12:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540889, 204832, 30214, '<td valign="top">macro outtake? Very nice shot, but how does it relate to independence?</td>', 'macro outtake? Very nice shot, but how does it relate to independence?', '2005-07-17 12:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540890, 202058, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really wel lthought out.  I love the crusty mud on the base of the boot and the way you faded the sharpness as you go up to the top. The laces laying as they do draws your eyes to the outert edge.  Perfect use of negative space with the white as the background to create contrast.  8</td>', 'This is really wel lthought out.  I love the crusty mud on the base of the boot and the way you faded the sharpness as you go up to the top. The laces laying as they do draws your eyes to the outert edge.  Perfect use of negative space with the white as the background to create contrast.  8', '2005-07-17 12:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540891, 204001, 30214, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition. One of my favorites!</td>', 'Fantastic composition. One of my favorites!', '2005-07-17 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540892, 204858, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the placement of the ice pieces as almost the basis for the sky to "grow out of them." The figture to the right grounds the image and I like him being in silhouette and not in color. The blue is stunning. The shadows along the ground and to the right are very effective in combination with the lighting.  Perfect use of a simple black framing technique. 9</td>', 'I love the placement of the ice pieces as almost the basis for the sky to "grow out of them." The figture to the right grounds the image and I like him being in silhouette and not in color. The blue is stunning. The shadows along the ground and to the right are very effective in combination with the lighting.  Perfect use of a simple black framing technique. 9', '2005-07-17 12:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540895, 204036, 15711, '<td valign="top">NOt at all your typical out of the window airplane shot.  The blue is so beautifully intense.  as it goes up toward the sratosphere. The almost black part at the top gives the feeling of an area that goes on infinitely. I love the flatness of the clouds billowing up into big puffy clusters. If this is heaven..... let me in!  Simply gorgeous. 9</td>', 'NOt at all your typical out of the window airplane shot.  The blue is so beautifully intense.  as it goes up toward the sratosphere. The almost black part at the top gives the feeling of an area that goes on infinitely. I love the flatness of the clouds billowing up into big puffy clusters. If this is heaven..... let me in!  Simply gorgeous. 9', '2005-07-17 12:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540896, 204776, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines! I like the simplicity and the cool of the water amidst the warm of the sand. The framing is perfect.  A simple as this it, I find it an extremely interesting capture. 8</td>', 'Great leading lines! I like the simplicity and the cool of the water amidst the warm of the sand. The framing is perfect.  A simple as this it, I find it an extremely interesting capture. 8', '2005-07-17 12:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540899, 204798, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the cloud bank. Usually a photo like this works better with a single figure, but with them being so far apart, the one in the distance draws your eye to the back. The white cuff of the little one''s jacket is a nice compliment to the light tones of the waves and the clouds. The use of a mustard type filter is an interesting take on it.  Your perspective from ground level makes this very effective. 8</td>', 'I love the cloud bank. Usually a photo like this works better with a single figure, but with them being so far apart, the one in the distance draws your eye to the back. The white cuff of the little one''s jacket is a nice compliment to the light tones of the waves and the clouds. The use of a mustard type filter is an interesting take on it.  Your perspective from ground level makes this very effective. 8', '2005-07-17 12:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540900, 204838, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice capture!</td>', 'nice capture!', '2005-07-17 12:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540901, 202165, 15711, '<td valign="top">The softness of this is really a nice touch. I love the shimmering reflection and your composition of the human and dog in the right. The human is dark and the dog is white, which is the perfect contrast to the rest of the black and white image.  I would hang this on my wall! 8</td>', 'The softness of this is really a nice touch. I love the shimmering reflection and your composition of the human and dog in the right. The human is dark and the dog is white, which is the perfect contrast to the rest of the black and white image.  I would hang this on my wall! 8', '2005-07-17 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540902, 203808, 2764, '<td valign="top">white balance seems off - too much magenta?</td>', 'white balance seems off - too much magenta?', '2005-07-17 12:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540903, 204420, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the detailing of this electric guitar. The dark red is a great compliment to the creamy white of thek nobs and levers. It has great leading lines as well.  This is an excellent use of light. 8</td>', 'I love the detailing of this electric guitar. The dark red is a great compliment to the creamy white of thek nobs and levers. It has great leading lines as well.  This is an excellent use of light. 8', '2005-07-17 12:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540907, 204844, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is so interesting.  I don''t know how you did it, but it''s quite effective.  The colors and clarity is spot on.  Are those checkers???? Lids?  Well, whatever, the varying sizes of the drops makes it very pleasing to the eye. 8</td>', 'This is so interesting.  I don''t know how you did it, but it''s quite effective.  The colors and clarity is spot on.  Are those checkers???? Lids?  Well, whatever, the varying sizes of the drops makes it very pleasing to the eye. 8', '2005-07-17 12:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540908, 203388, 2764, '<td valign="top">wonderful expressions - im not sure which one is Dad but it''s obvious who is the defiant teen.</td>', 'wonderful expressions - im not sure which one is Dad but it''s obvious who is the defiant teen.', '2005-07-17 12:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540909, 203969, 2764, '<td valign="top">too much processing for my taste.</td>', 'too much processing for my taste.', '2005-07-17 12:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540912, 204603, 2764, '<td valign="top">hey - your money is prettier than our money.</td>', 'hey - your money is prettier than our money.', '2005-07-17 12:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540914, 204241, 15711, '<td valign="top">The leading lines of this photo is subtle yet effectual. The varied colors could be distracting but because the middle and last woman have on a pastel colored top, the design and brightness of the first one in focus, just gives it more pop. Good  use of light.  The skin tones are natural.</td>', 'The leading lines of this photo is subtle yet effectual. The varied colors could be distracting but because the middle and last woman have on a pastel colored top, the design and brightness of the first one in focus, just gives it more pop. Good  use of light.  The skin tones are natural.', '2005-07-17 12:28:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1540919, 204862, 15711, '<td valign="top">The rounded qualities of the cello, his head and the legs of the chair are a nice contrast to all of the straight lines and angles of the steps and bricks. I love that some of them are white - creating an interesting yet non-distracting foreground.  I think I would have cropped out part of the upper third and maybe placed myself so the circular part of the building is not directly over his head. 7</td>', 'The rounded qualities of the cello, his head and the legs of the chair are a nice contrast to all of the straight lines and angles of the steps and bricks. I love that some of them are white - creating an interesting yet non-distracting foreground.  I think I would have cropped out part of the upper third and maybe placed myself so the circular part of the building is not directly over his head. 7', '2005-07-17 12:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540924, 204800, 15711, '<td valign="top">This seems a tad dull to me. Maybe due to the overcast sky or time of day. The compositioin is quite good.  Maybe if you could beef up the blue of the water, and the contrast, it might have a bit more pizzazz. I hope you found this helpful.</td>', 'This seems a tad dull to me. Maybe due to the overcast sky or time of day. The compositioin is quite good.  Maybe if you could beef up the blue of the water, and the contrast, it might have a bit more pizzazz. I hope you found this helpful.', '2005-07-17 12:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540927, 204618, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of image but effective. The lighting and filter is interesting. He is glowing. I like the perfecty symmetrical position of his body and hands.  How''d you do that with basic editing???</td>', 'Interesting choice of image but effective. The lighting and filter is interesting. He is glowing. I like the perfecty symmetrical position of his body and hands.  How''d you do that with basic editing???', '2005-07-17 12:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540928, 204763, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s truly a stunning image against the blackened background. I''m sure you''ll get slams for the flower, but it''s independence from any other blooms works for me. 7</td>', 'It''s truly a stunning image against the blackened background. I''m sure you''ll get slams for the flower, but it''s independence from any other blooms works for me. 7', '2005-07-17 12:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540929, 204479, 2764, '<td valign="top">more pixels please.  you are never going to get a decent score on a mini picture - common newcomers mistake - you are allowed 640 x 640, use as much of it as you can.</td>', 'more pixels please.  you are never going to get a decent score on a mini picture - common newcomers mistake - you are allowed 640 x 640, use as much of it as you can.', '2005-07-17 12:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540930, 203866, 15711, '<td valign="top">The water and spray is lovely. I like that it''s dark and the llight on the edge of the surfboard leads your eye to the back. I''d like to see a little more sky above his head.  Overall - a good capture.</td>', 'The water and spray is lovely. I like that it''s dark and the llight on the edge of the surfboard leads your eye to the back. I''d like to see a little more sky above his head.  Overall - a good capture.', '2005-07-17 12:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540932, 204515, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice movement shot. Black and white is the perfect filter for it. I''d maybe up the contrast in her hair a bit, but with basic editing, that might''ve been impossible.  The lighting is not too harsh.  Very darling girl!!</td>', 'Nice movement shot. Black and white is the perfect filter for it. I''d maybe up the contrast in her hair a bit, but with basic editing, that might''ve been impossible.  The lighting is not too harsh.  Very darling girl!!', '2005-07-17 12:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540933, 204670, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this - even the cropping of his right wing is effective. I like that the pole is angled. Nice light. The halo  around his wings is a nice touch.</td>', 'I like this - even the cropping of his right wing is effective. I like that the pole is angled. Nice light. The halo  around his wings is a nice touch.', '2005-07-17 12:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540935, 203362, 2764, '<td valign="top">how did he get so metalic?</td>', 'how did he get so metalic?', '2005-07-17 12:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540937, 204174, 22970, '<td valign="top">Subject Impact: High<br/>Meets Challenge: High<br/>Technical: Average<br/>Composition: Average<br/>Creativity: Average<br/> <br/>Score: 7</td>', 'Subject Impact: HighMeets Challenge: HighTechnical: AverageComposition: AverageCreativity: Average Score: 7', '2005-07-17 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540938, 203336, 15711, '<td valign="top">I never thought I''d see Jay Leno in a challenge shot! The light and blured background works.  His face could be a tad more sharp for my taste.   A good candid shot.</td>', 'I never thought I''d see Jay Leno in a challenge shot! The light and blured background works.  His face could be a tad more sharp for my taste.   A good candid shot.', '2005-07-17 12:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540940, 202165, 22970, '<td valign="top">Subject Impact: Low<br/>Meets Challenge: High<br/>Technical: Low<br/>Composition: Average<br/>Creativity: High<br/> <br/>Score: 6</td>', 'Subject Impact: LowMeets Challenge: HighTechnical: LowComposition: AverageCreativity: High Score: 6', '2005-07-17 12:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540941, 204797, 15711, '<td valign="top">Thank you for not laying out everything all straight and symmetrical. The angles make this much more interesting. The intense colors of the flag, the sepia of the photo and the shine of the bracelet are nice contrasts. I''m sure you''ll get some comments that this is cliche or trite, but of this type of image,  I like it alot.</td>', 'Thank you for not laying out everything all straight and symmetrical. The angles make this much more interesting. The intense colors of the flag, the sepia of the photo and the shine of the bracelet are nice contrasts. I''m sure you''ll get some comments that this is cliche or trite, but of this type of image,  I like it alot.', '2005-07-17 12:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540942, 204676, 22970, '<td valign="top">Subject Impact: Low<br/>Meets Challenge: Average<br/>Technical: Average<br/>Composition: Average<br/>Creativity: Low<br/> <br/>Score: 4</td>', 'Subject Impact: LowMeets Challenge: AverageTechnical: AverageComposition: AverageCreativity: Low Score: 4', '2005-07-17 12:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540943, 203736, 22970, '<td valign="top">Subject Impact: High<br/>Meets Challenge: Average<br/>Technical: Average<br/>Composition: Average<br/>Creativity: Average<br/> <br/>Score: 6</td>', 'Subject Impact: HighMeets Challenge: AverageTechnical: AverageComposition: AverageCreativity: Average Score: 6', '2005-07-17 12:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540944, 202768, 22970, '<td valign="top">Subject Impact: High<br/>Meets Challenge: High<br/>Technical: Average<br/>Composition: Average<br/>Creativity: Average<br/> <br/>Score: 7</td>', 'Subject Impact: HighMeets Challenge: HighTechnical: AverageComposition: AverageCreativity: Average Score: 7', '2005-07-17 12:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540945, 203477, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the deeper tones of the red white and blue. The furled flag is nicely done. Good use of light and stop motion. The way you chose to shoot this type image doesn''t make it trite or cliche.</td>', 'I like the deeper tones of the red white and blue. The furled flag is nicely done. Good use of light and stop motion. The way you chose to shoot this type image doesn''t make it trite or cliche.', '2005-07-17 12:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540946, 202066, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this shot. The medal against the fabric of the flag and paper of the document is effective. I don''t usually go for the staged photos per se, but I like this one''s rich tone and color.  Overall composition is quite good.</td>', 'I like the angle of this shot. The medal against the fabric of the flag and paper of the document is effective. I don''t usually go for the staged photos per se, but I like this one''s rich tone and color.  Overall composition is quite good.', '2005-07-17 12:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540949, 204079, 15711, '<td valign="top">This speaks to me for some reason.  I think it''s the dark rich tones against the white of the waves. Some might find it lacking in  light, but that''s what draws me to it more.The leading lines take your eye all the way through the photo.  8</td>', 'This speaks to me for some reason.  I think it''s the dark rich tones against the white of the waves. Some might find it lacking in  light, but that''s what draws me to it more.The leading lines take your eye all the way through the photo.  8', '2005-07-17 12:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540952, 204838, 15711, '<td valign="top">I loved this the first time I saw it but I failed to comment.  The softness of the focus with the single seed floating away is just stunning. The background couldn''t be more perfect of a backdrop for the white. The green adds a nice bit of punch as well. 8</td>', 'I loved this the first time I saw it but I failed to comment.  The softness of the focus with the single seed floating away is just stunning. The background couldn''t be more perfect of a backdrop for the white. The green adds a nice bit of punch as well. 8', '2005-07-17 12:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540953, 204001, 2764, '<td valign="top">powerful concept, best interpretation of the challange - photo is very dark on my monitor, is there more to see besides the fists, ropes and sun?  why not a vertical orientarion for the image?  might add the the thrusting up movement.</td>', 'powerful concept, best interpretation of the challange - photo is very dark on my monitor, is there more to see besides the fists, ropes and sun?  why not a vertical orientarion for the image?  might add the the thrusting up movement.', '2005-07-17 12:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540954, 203630, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really a great candid shot. The determined look, the detail and the color is well shot.  Maybe bring up the light a tad on the child''s face and hair.</td>', 'This is really a great candid shot. The determined look, the detail and the color is well shot.  Maybe bring up the light a tad on the child''s face and hair.', '2005-07-17 12:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540958, 204409, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line up to the boat. The red in the water is a nice touch of contrast. The water reflection is good.</td>', 'Nice leading line up to the boat. The red in the water is a nice touch of contrast. The water reflection is good.', '2005-07-17 12:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540960, 204832, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great macro. I wish more of his body were in focus as well. LIghting on his head is good. Good use of contrast with the red and green.  I''m sure you''ll get slammed for the subject meeting the challenge, but I still think it''s a good photo. 7</td>', 'Great macro. I wish more of his body were in focus as well. LIghting on his head is good. Good use of contrast with the red and green.  I''m sure you''ll get slammed for the subject meeting the challenge, but I still think it''s a good photo. 7', '2005-07-17 12:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540963, 204174, 15711, '<td valign="top">The building is glowing behind the statue. Maybe a tad too green for my taste, but the overall composition is done well.  I wish there were more light on his upper body, to make him stand out more.</td>', 'The building is glowing behind the statue. Maybe a tad too green for my taste, but the overall composition is done well.  I wish there were more light on his upper body, to make him stand out more.', '2005-07-17 12:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540965, 202730, 15711, '<td valign="top">The glare  coming through the window is too harsh for my taste. The silhouette is ok, but the angle seems a bit awkward as does her pose.  Her face is totally lost in shadow, which might have been your intent, but I find it less appealing than if you could have seen more of it with ligh hitting her face.</td>', 'The glare  coming through the window is too harsh for my taste. The silhouette is ok, but the angle seems a bit awkward as does her pose.  Her face is totally lost in shadow, which might have been your intent, but I find it less appealing than if you could have seen more of it with ligh hitting her face.', '2005-07-17 12:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1540969, 203889, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish this were more rich and not so yellow. Maybe bring up the gray tones a bit more. The light on her cheekbones is nice and the use of negative space works for me. Maybe crop out part of the left side just a smidge.</td>', 'I wish this were more rich and not so yellow. Maybe bring up the gray tones a bit more. The light on her cheekbones is nice and the use of negative space works for me. Maybe crop out part of the left side just a smidge.', '2005-07-17 13:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
