(1541674, 203731, 34059, '<td valign="top">wow, that''s a great idea! wonderful execution, too... you can even see the circle around the needle. I also love the title, if I could vote this would be a 10! mmm... it made me thirsty :)</td>', 'wow, that''s a great idea! wonderful execution, too... you can even see the circle around the needle. I also love the title, if I could vote this would be a 10! mmm... it made me thirsty :)', '2005-07-17 20:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541676, 204619, 2780, '<td valign="top">Its a shame the background is so overexposed. It''s a nice portrait but I think like lighting (from your flash?) is too flat and devoids the shot of some emotion.</td>', 'Its a shame the background is so overexposed. It''s a nice portrait but I think like lighting (from your flash?) is too flat and devoids the shot of some emotion.', '2005-07-17 20:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541691, 204409, 2780, '<td valign="top">This could have been quite a nice shot but I think it was ruined by post processing. There is no dynamic range, all the brightness is too similar, with no real highlights and no real shadows, and a blue cast over eveything. I think it would look much better in B&amp;W with the contrast much higher.</td>', 'This could have been quite a nice shot but I think it was ruined by post processing. There is no dynamic range, all the brightness is too similar, with no real highlights and no real shadows, and a blue cast over eveything. I think it would look much better in B&W with the contrast much higher.', '2005-07-17 21:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541697, 204630, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think it''s sharpened too much, as shown by the jaggies on the wires, and the exposure was too long, since all ther highlights are blown out and the black shadows are actually grey. Is your monitor calibrated properly? I think it could be too dark.</td>', 'I think it''s sharpened too much, as shown by the jaggies on the wires, and the exposure was too long, since all ther highlights are blown out and the black shadows are actually grey. Is your monitor calibrated properly? I think it could be too dark.', '2005-07-17 21:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541703, 204889, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''ve applied neatimage too heavily. I would have preferred grain.</td>', 'Looks like you''ve applied neatimage too heavily. I would have preferred grain.', '2005-07-17 21:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541711, 204479, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get this comment a million times but this is too small :( Shame because apart from the over-exposure of the lights this could potentially have been a nice entry. I''m not sure how it meets the challenge though.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get this comment a million times but this is too small :( Shame because apart from the over-exposure of the lights this could potentially have been a nice entry. I''m not sure how it meets the challenge though.', '2005-07-17 21:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541715, 203969, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not really keen on the post-processing effect.</td>', 'I''m not really keen on the post-processing effect.', '2005-07-17 21:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541721, 204461, 2780, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is a self portrait... or how it''s independence, and i think it''s too centered. Doesnt really hold much appeal with me.</td>', 'Not sure how this is a self portrait... or how it''s independence, and i think it''s too centered. Doesnt really hold much appeal with me.', '2005-07-17 21:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541733, 204784, 2780, '<td valign="top">Slightly on the soft side. A small application of USM would help I think.</td>', 'Slightly on the soft side. A small application of USM would help I think.', '2005-07-17 21:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541746, 204817, 36628, '<td valign="top">The purple effect is cool in the sky and the water, but it shows up so many other places that it makes it very unnatural and fake looking.</td>', 'The purple effect is cool in the sky and the water, but it shows up so many other places that it makes it very unnatural and fake looking.', '2005-07-17 21:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541754, 204658, 2780, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit soft to me, and the exposure looked tough, but I think you managed to make it look okay in the end.</td>', 'This seems a bit soft to me, and the exposure looked tough, but I think you managed to make it look okay in the end.', '2005-07-17 21:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541755, 204684, 36628, '<td valign="top">Im not sure if its just light pollution or the time the picture was taken, but the redness of the sky is a little weird. There is also some color noise which is a little distracting.</td>', 'Im not sure if its just light pollution or the time the picture was taken, but the redness of the sky is a little weird. There is also some color noise which is a little distracting.', '2005-07-17 21:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541812, 204024, 9747, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot! I think it would''ve been better/fitting if there were only one person instead of two. The borders are a tad thick but that''s just my opinion. B&amp;W is a great choice for this picture! Beautiful scene.</td>', 'Lovely shot! I think it would''ve been better/fitting if there were only one person instead of two. The borders are a tad thick but that''s just my opinion. B&W is a great choice for this picture! Beautiful scene.', '2005-07-17 21:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541817, 204800, 9747, '<td valign="top">Nice! But the colors are a little flat. Perhaps try adjusting contrast/curves/levels? Or convert it into a B&amp;W? All in all, a good shot! I like how the boat and its mast stands out.</td>', 'Nice! But the colors are a little flat. Perhaps try adjusting contrast/curves/levels? Or convert it into a B&W? All in all, a good shot! I like how the boat and its mast stands out.', '2005-07-17 22:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541820, 203731, 36981, '<td valign="top">This cracked me up.  I love the image; what a great idea &amp; capture!  Okay, it doesn''t really say "independence" to me, but the title made me laugh.  9</td>', 'This cracked me up.  I love the image; what a great idea & capture!  Okay, it doesn''t really say "independence" to me, but the title made me laugh.  9', '2005-07-17 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
