(1541952, 204044, 39610, '<td valign="top">very untinteresting subject, ie another point of view might have made it much more interesting. Might have cropped it much more. The lighting creates to sharp a shadow around the key.</td>', 'very untinteresting subject, ie another point of view might have made it much more interesting. Might have cropped it much more. The lighting creates to sharp a shadow around the key.', '2005-07-17 23:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541958, 204164, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very creative and unique. It''s a pleasure to see something different. Thanks for taking the chance. Intriguing...how''d you do it? Nice lighting, including special effects.  SHARP. 10</td>', 'Very creative and unique. It''s a pleasure to see something different. Thanks for taking the chance. Intriguing...how''d you do it? Nice lighting, including special effects.  SHARP. 10', '2005-07-17 23:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541963, 203397, 39610, '<td valign="top">very uninteresting setup.</td>', 'very uninteresting setup.', '2005-07-17 23:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541975, 203167, 37719, '<td valign="top">First round thought - well, interesting but I needed a perspective.  Second round I thought - well, definitely not literal, but very well done.  Capture is perfect and the exposure is excellent.  Gave it an 8 and went on the bump up list.  Third pass...I looked for a few minutes and thought about the mechanics of the shot, the time, creativity and what I perceived as the thought pattern.  It got bumped to a 10.  Very nice shot.  Made me think and caught my attention instantly.  Well done!</td>', 'First round thought - well, interesting but I needed a perspective.  Second round I thought - well, definitely not literal, but very well done.  Capture is perfect and the exposure is excellent.  Gave it an 8 and went on the bump up list.  Third pass...I looked for a few minutes and thought about the mechanics of the shot, the time, creativity and what I perceived as the thought pattern.  It got bumped to a 10.  Very nice shot.  Made me think and caught my attention instantly.  Well done!', '2005-07-17 23:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541981, 202730, 39610, '<td valign="top">I find this a bit to awkwardly posed almost unconfortable. If she would turn more towards the window and lean against it that would feel more natural. Or not ;-)</td>', 'I find this a bit to awkwardly posed almost unconfortable. If she would turn more towards the window and lean against it that would feel more natural. Or not ;-)', '2005-07-17 23:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541984, 204687, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a great subject, and I really like the composition.  The lighting has done some wonderful things to the photo; but it has also done some terrible things   Right in the middle of the photo the pigtail shadow and the triangle of light on the shadowed hand create some confusion, IMO.  And the blown white highlights of the cotton tops somehow add to the confusion and distracton.</td>', 'It''s a great subject, and I really like the composition.  The lighting has done some wonderful things to the photo; but it has also done some terrible things   Right in the middle of the photo the pigtail shadow and the triangle of light on the shadowed hand create some confusion, IMO.  And the blown white highlights of the cotton tops somehow add to the confusion and distracton.', '2005-07-17 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541989, 202768, 33560, '<td valign="top">A lot of life here.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'A lot of life here.  Nicely captured.', '2005-07-17 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541991, 203731, 29904, '<td valign="top">Ahh I''ve seen this before from my photo instructor.  Perfectly executed!  Done with a strobe light wired with the camera?  I would love to try this if you don''t mind publishing the ''how-to'' with details.<br/>Thanks!<br/>10</td>', 'Ahh I''ve seen this before from my photo instructor.  Perfectly executed!  Done with a strobe light wired with the camera?  I would love to try this if you don''t mind publishing the ''how-to'' with details.Thanks!10', '2005-07-17 23:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1541993, 204888, 39610, '<td valign="top">Wow, there are so many car key pictures and we are so dependent on cars. Good feature of this image is that it''s BW and the lighting is o.k.</td>', 'Wow, there are so many car key pictures and we are so dependent on cars. Good feature of this image is that it''s BW and the lighting is o.k.', '2005-07-17 23:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542001, 204882, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful interpretation and shot.  Some of us still believe.</td>', 'wonderful interpretation and shot.  Some of us still believe.', '2005-07-17 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542004, 204855, 33560, '<td valign="top">It can be extremely difficult to capture, from the top of a mountain, the grandeur one experiences.  Usually when one adds figures to these kinds of lanscapes they are distant so we get a sense of scale.    The subject is nestled nicely into the powerful part of the photo. and the exposure is perfect, but somehow neither the person nor the rugged terrain seem to carry the photo.   Doubt it would make a big difference here, but when faced with photos where the colors don''t add much, you might consider trying B&amp;W.</td>', 'It can be extremely difficult to capture, from the top of a mountain, the grandeur one experiences.  Usually when one adds figures to these kinds of lanscapes they are distant so we get a sense of scale.    The subject is nestled nicely into the powerful part of the photo. and the exposure is perfect, but somehow neither the person nor the rugged terrain seem to carry the photo.   Doubt it would make a big difference here, but when faced with photos where the colors don''t add much, you might consider trying B&W.', '2005-07-17 23:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542007, 204559, 3569, '<td valign="top">An in your face bald eagle, right on</td>', 'An in your face bald eagle, right on', '2005-07-17 23:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
