(1542106, 204763, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!  The lighting is perfect.  Nice background.  Focus couldn''t be more perfect.  I feel as if I could reach out and touch the petals.  Good job!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!  The lighting is perfect.  Nice background.  Focus couldn''t be more perfect.  I feel as if I could reach out and touch the petals.  Good job!!', '2005-07-18 00:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
