(1542111, 204861, 33560, '<td valign="top">Super.  I love the expression.  Occasionally a perfect title will really make a photo shine; that''s the case here.  It appears that the lighting created a yellow cast to the photo. Normally I find this quite objectionable; but in this cas it warms the photo immensely and  strengthens is much.</td>', 'Super.  I love the expression.  Occasionally a perfect title will really make a photo shine; that''s the case here.  It appears that the lighting created a yellow cast to the photo. Normally I find this quite objectionable; but in this cas it warms the photo immensely and  strengthens is much.', '2005-07-18 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542113, 203436, 33352, '<td valign="top">One of the standout images in this challenge,I particually like the contrast of sunlit Alamo, against the grey sky....10</td>', 'One of the standout images in this challenge,I particually like the contrast of sunlit Alamo, against the grey sky....10', '2005-07-18 00:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542116, 203731, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  There are ways I can imagine to improve it, but I can see you are so far ahead of me you don''t need my help.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  There are ways I can imagine to improve it, but I can see you are so far ahead of me you don''t need my help.', '2005-07-18 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542121, 204776, 33352, '<td valign="top">I Like the idea,and the contrast of see and sand, but the foot prints comming to you draw me out of the photo.....5</td>', 'I Like the idea,and the contrast of see and sand, but the foot prints comming to you draw me out of the photo.....5', '2005-07-18 00:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542122, 203731, 33352, '<td valign="top">well done...7</td>', 'well done...7', '2005-07-18 00:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542124, 204516, 33560, '<td valign="top">Talk about framing a shot!.  I love it.  I wonder if you considered cropping a bit off the top. I think it might be better, possibly, if much of the wood lintel were cropped off.  And I do wish I could see the faces just a little bit better.  Still, it''s a fun point of view</td>', 'Talk about framing a shot!.  I love it.  I wonder if you considered cropping a bit off the top. I think it might be better, possibly, if much of the wood lintel were cropped off.  And I do wish I could see the faces just a little bit better.  Still, it''s a fun point of view', '2005-07-18 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542126, 204036, 33352, '<td valign="top">The top of the image is distracting,I would have cropped below,just above the grey cloud....7</td>', 'The top of the image is distracting,I would have cropped below,just above the grey cloud....7', '2005-07-18 00:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542129, 202753, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  This is a very unusual point of view.  I love the texture of the hand and of the denim.  It''s great to see the car, but I''m finding the headlight just a little overpowering.  I''ve tried looking at it with all the headlight cropped out fully and half of it cropped out, and I think I agree that its existence is necessary to set up a kind of visual tension that parallels the tension of the ''dad'' in the title: still, I think if it were half gone the tension would still be there.  Love to know what you think.</td>', 'Nice concept.  This is a very unusual point of view.  I love the texture of the hand and of the denim.  It''s great to see the car, but I''m finding the headlight just a little overpowering.  I''ve tried looking at it with all the headlight cropped out fully and half of it cropped out, and I think I agree that its existence is necessary to set up a kind of visual tension that parallels the tension of the ''dad'' in the title: still, I think if it were half gone the tension would still be there.  Love to know what you think.', '2005-07-18 00:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542130, 204241, 25553, '<td valign="top">very nice.. id like to hear a little about what they were protesting about. its one of the most impressive pics ive seen for this challenge. the details and composition are great!  the fact that you  cant see their eyes creates mystery and their poses unites them in their protest. i like that they are barefoot aswell.</td>', 'very nice.. id like to hear a little about what they were protesting about. its one of the most impressive pics ive seen for this challenge. the details and composition are great!  the fact that you  cant see their eyes creates mystery and their poses unites them in their protest. i like that they are barefoot aswell.', '2005-07-18 00:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542131, 204028, 33181, '<td valign="top">i wish</td>', 'i wish', '2005-07-18 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542132, 204813, 18799, '<td valign="top">I get your meaning here.  I''m not real keen on the blue color cast - I don''t know if it was intentional or your white balance was off.</td>', 'I get your meaning here.  I''m not real keen on the blue color cast - I don''t know if it was intentional or your white balance was off.', '2005-07-18 00:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542133, 202775, 37730, '<td valign="top">She turns her back on the obvious way.....where will she go?  I guess any way she wants......Independence (until Daddy picks her up, of course!)  Nice pic.</td>', 'She turns her back on the obvious way.....where will she go?  I guess any way she wants......Independence (until Daddy picks her up, of course!)  Nice pic.', '2005-07-18 00:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542134, 203783, 25553, '<td valign="top">very nice how they almost blend in but they dont.. it reminds me of the digital world in thirteenth floor..</td>', 'very nice how they almost blend in but they dont.. it reminds me of the digital world in thirteenth floor..', '2005-07-18 00:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542136, 204817, 33560, '<td valign="top">I should be very surprised if this is what the camera saw - looks like we just took the green gamma curve down a few notches. It''s a little wierd, but it mostly works, I think.  The  stick in the foreground is a problem. And the white whatsit behind the fisherman is a distraction. Otherwise, a good effort.</td>', 'I should be very surprised if this is what the camera saw - looks like we just took the green gamma curve down a few notches. It''s a little wierd, but it mostly works, I think.  The  stick in the foreground is a problem. And the white whatsit behind the fisherman is a distraction. Otherwise, a good effort.', '2005-07-18 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542142, 204432, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t think all that white sky adds anything to the image and I would have cropped most of it out.</td>', 'I don''t think all that white sky adds anything to the image and I would have cropped most of it out.', '2005-07-18 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542149, 202066, 33181, '<td valign="top">hmmm I see a nuke here</td>', 'hmmm I see a nuke here', '2005-07-18 00:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542153, 204819, 33181, '<td valign="top">nice to see a picture from home</td>', 'nice to see a picture from home', '2005-07-18 00:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542154, 204862, 33560, '<td valign="top">Exquisite.  At first we think ''this could only have been taken in Europe: Americans simply don''t use nice wooden chairs outside."  And then we think " This could only be taken in America: Europeans do not play cellos in jeans and black running shoes."    This defiance of categorization adds to its beauty  immensely.  The lighting, texture, colors, framing, and all are very nice.  One wishes, just a bit, that the subject''s head did not so nearly match the mottled background.  And one wonders whether taking the blue out killed some subtle highlights in the shirt, shoes, and case.  (if so, some channel mixing might have worked here.)  Still, it''s a lovely shot.</td>', 'Exquisite.  At first we think ''this could only have been taken in Europe: Americans simply don''t use nice wooden chairs outside."  And then we think " This could only be taken in America: Europeans do not play cellos in jeans and black running shoes."    This defiance of categorization adds to its beauty  immensely.  The lighting, texture, colors, framing, and all are very nice.  One wishes, just a bit, that the subject''s head did not so nearly match the mottled background.  And one wonders whether taking the blue out killed some subtle highlights in the shirt, shoes, and case.  (if so, some channel mixing might have worked here.)  Still, it''s a lovely shot.', '2005-07-18 00:39:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1542159, 204515, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great model, Nice expression.</td>', 'Great model, Nice expression.', '2005-07-18 00:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542164, 204608, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sometimes freedom is ''no strings attached.''   This would not appear to be one of those times.  It''s an unusual shot.  The subject is perfectly placed in the photo.  Exposure is perfect.  Great lines ( in more ways than one.}</td>', 'Sometimes freedom is ''no strings attached.''   This would not appear to be one of those times.  It''s an unusual shot.  The subject is perfectly placed in the photo.  Exposure is perfect.  Great lines ( in more ways than one.}', '2005-07-18 00:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542168, 204814, 33560, '<td valign="top">The lighting and texture are superb.  Framing is super.  Ordinarily I would wish to see the subject''s face just a little better; but somehow, the fact that we see both hands so well makes up for it.</td>', 'The lighting and texture are superb.  Framing is super.  Ordinarily I would wish to see the subject''s face just a little better; but somehow, the fact that we see both hands so well makes up for it.', '2005-07-18 00:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542178, 203731, 3669, '<td valign="top">Definately a neat shot.  Nice timing.</td>', 'Definately a neat shot.  Nice timing.', '2005-07-18 00:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542248, 204860, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.  Nice Colors &amp; Lighting.  The expression is quite ambiguous.  Slightly pensive, perhaps. There seems to be something missing, a bit, from the photo, don''t know what it is.  <br/> <br/>One might try cropping the photo in such a way as to remove all the background from behind the subject and the top of the head. This focuses our attention on the eyes and lips a bit more, which I think, strengthens the photo.</td>', 'Great DOF.  Nice Colors & Lighting.  The expression is quite ambiguous.  Slightly pensive, perhaps. There seems to be something missing, a bit, from the photo, don''t know what it is.   One might try cropping the photo in such a way as to remove all the background from behind the subject and the top of the head. This focuses our attention on the eyes and lips a bit more, which I think, strengthens the photo.', '2005-07-18 01:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542265, 204838, 33560, '<td valign="top">Pay no attention to the guys who object to the noise in th background.  This is an exceptional variation on the dandilion shot.  Very nice.</td>', 'Pay no attention to the guys who object to the noise in th background.  This is an exceptional variation on the dandilion shot.  Very nice.', '2005-07-18 01:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542289, 204522, 33560, '<td valign="top">The vignetting in the corners, IMO weakens the photo much.  It''s not so much the vignetting per se as it is the strong color shift.  Perhaps if the photo were rendered in B&amp;W or if some clever channel mixing method had been employed to fix this effect, the photo would be better.  I suspect there are a number of other post processing tricks that might pull more fluffy texture out of the clouds and so on.  Seems like a good starting point and a bit of a missed opportunity.</td>', 'The vignetting in the corners, IMO weakens the photo much.  It''s not so much the vignetting per se as it is the strong color shift.  Perhaps if the photo were rendered in B&W or if some clever channel mixing method had been employed to fix this effect, the photo would be better.  I suspect there are a number of other post processing tricks that might pull more fluffy texture out of the clouds and so on.  Seems like a good starting point and a bit of a missed opportunity.', '2005-07-18 01:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542334, 204801, 33560, '<td valign="top">I can say with some confidence that this is among the better photos I''ve seen of dead mums. The lighting works well, but the photo seems a little cluttered - especially with the leaf in the lower  left corner. The subject flowers (based on the title) seem a little less sharply focused than the dead ones. And since our eye is drawn to the white ones, it is always a bit of a disappointment to  see them be fuzzy.</td>', 'I can say with some confidence that this is among the better photos I''ve seen of dead mums. The lighting works well, but the photo seems a little cluttered - especially with the leaf in the lower  left corner. The subject flowers (based on the title) seem a little less sharply focused than the dead ones. And since our eye is drawn to the white ones, it is always a bit of a disappointment to  see them be fuzzy.', '2005-07-18 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542339, 204079, 33560, '<td valign="top">I would love to see just a tad more detail in the dark parts of the rocks.</td>', 'I would love to see just a tad more detail in the dark parts of the rocks.', '2005-07-18 01:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542377, 204468, 33560, '<td valign="top">The old saying seems to be coming true "Cheetah''s never prosper."  Nice shot of a disappearing breed.</td>', 'The old saying seems to be coming true "Cheetah''s never prosper."  Nice shot of a disappearing breed.', '2005-07-18 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542538, 204001, 39483, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far! Wonderful sun, lighting, colors and idea! the only small distraction is that the sun is a bit fuzzy... (but it was probably setting fast!)<br/>I hope you get a ribbon!<br/></td>', 'My favorite so far! Wonderful sun, lighting, colors and idea! the only small distraction is that the sun is a bit fuzzy... (but it was probably setting fast!)I hope you get a ribbon!', '2005-07-18 01:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542564, 204241, 39483, '<td valign="top">The depth of field and composition are great. I really like the diagonal that the hands make, it leads the eyes into the picture.<br/>I wonder though if this might work better in black and white... The colors of the clothes are a bit distracting to me. <br/>Long live dissent!</td>', 'The depth of field and composition are great. I really like the diagonal that the hands make, it leads the eyes into the picture.I wonder though if this might work better in black and white... The colors of the clothes are a bit distracting to me. Long live dissent!', '2005-07-18 01:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542601, 204437, 39483, '<td valign="top">Very original photo! I like the idea of the reflecting window with this VERY powerful message! The crossing lane and the buliding lines reminded me of the lines of the american flag...<br/>I might have cropped it a bit different although you probably didn''t have much choice with the perspective. I think there is a way in PS to force somewhat converging lines into straight parallel ones? not sure...<br/>Well done</td>', 'Very original photo! I like the idea of the reflecting window with this VERY powerful message! The crossing lane and the buliding lines reminded me of the lines of the american flag...I might have cropped it a bit different although you probably didn''t have much choice with the perspective. I think there is a way in PS to force somewhat converging lines into straight parallel ones? not sure...Well done', '2005-07-18 02:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542670, 202165, 39483, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this picture! Very original processing. The composition is well balanced and the clouds really add to the mood of the photo.<br/>Well done!<br/>PS:  I just started using borders so I''m a bit fixated on that but a tiny (a few pixels) black border might have added a contrast from the grey "voting" backgroung?</td>', 'I love the feel of this picture! Very original processing. The composition is well balanced and the clouds really add to the mood of the photo.Well done!PS:  I just started using borders so I''m a bit fixated on that but a tiny (a few pixels) black border might have added a contrast from the grey "voting" backgroung?', '2005-07-18 02:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542680, 203814, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the contrast between the white dress and the very blue water. The arms also work well with the challenge! I might have cropped it a bit differently so her right arm and legs aren''t so close to he photo''s edge? I wonder how it looks in B&amp;W??<br/>Well done!</td>', 'I like the idea and the contrast between the white dress and the very blue water. The arms also work well with the challenge! I might have cropped it a bit differently so her right arm and legs aren''t so close to he photo''s edge? I wonder how it looks in B&W??Well done!', '2005-07-18 02:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542681, 202708, 28742, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened and halo''d, but a nice capture!</td>', 'A bit oversharpened and halo''d, but a nice capture!', '2005-07-18 02:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542691, 202775, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus and color and a cute little girl! Wish the feet weren''t cut off though.</td>', 'Very nice focus and color and a cute little girl! Wish the feet weren''t cut off though.', '2005-07-18 02:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542697, 203731, 28742, '<td valign="top">Oh man! I saw this setup in a photo mag and have been dying to try to get a shot like this. Can''t wait to see the details! ...you will post the details, won''t you?? :)</td>', 'Oh man! I saw this setup in a photo mag and have been dying to try to get a shot like this. Can''t wait to see the details! ...you will post the details, won''t you?? :)', '2005-07-18 02:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542702, 203653, 39483, '<td valign="top">What an amazing black and white photo! The contrast and depth of field are amazing, the composition well balanced (the extra swing works great), and I love how the eye peeks out from the chain link! I honestly can''t think of anything to do different...<br/>Well done and great message!</td>', 'What an amazing black and white photo! The contrast and depth of field are amazing, the composition well balanced (the extra swing works great), and I love how the eye peeks out from the chain link! I honestly can''t think of anything to do different...Well done and great message!', '2005-07-18 02:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542708, 204043, 28742, '<td valign="top">San Diego - by the USS Midway museaum? Nicely done - has some relevvant elements for sure.</td>', 'San Diego - by the USS Midway museaum? Nicely done - has some relevvant elements for sure.', '2005-07-18 02:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542711, 204817, 28742, '<td valign="top">Too Surreal - Too pink. Everything else seems pretty good and misght have made for a solid image. The color is too much to overlook.</td>', 'Too Surreal - Too pink. Everything else seems pretty good and misght have made for a solid image. The color is too much to overlook.', '2005-07-18 02:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542717, 202775, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great expression, color and pose. The out of focus and receeding road also works well with the photo. Very minor detail but the telephone post (?) with the white box distracts just a tad...cropping it out might have worked better?<br/>Well done! She does seem to have an independent streak :)</td>', 'Great expression, color and pose. The out of focus and receeding road also works well with the photo. Very minor detail but the telephone post (?) with the white box distracts just a tad...cropping it out might have worked better?Well done! She does seem to have an independent streak :)', '2005-07-18 02:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542718, 203388, 28742, '<td valign="top">Here''s another title/caption: "We''ll be independent once our time has been served and they remove these ankle bracelets." ;-)</td>', 'Here''s another title/caption: "We''ll be independent once our time has been served and they remove these ankle bracelets." ;-)', '2005-07-18 02:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542726, 204845, 28742, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot! Except for her expression, this is something for Mom or Dad''s office wall or desk. Hard to relate this to the challenge, but interpreting very broad for this one. Good luck!</td>', 'I like this a lot! Except for her expression, this is something for Mom or Dad''s office wall or desk. Hard to relate this to the challenge, but interpreting very broad for this one. Good luck!', '2005-07-18 02:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542730, 204846, 39483, '<td valign="top">I recently saw some art photos of lone persons in the middle of totally empty and seemingly vast oceans, sand beaches, parking lots...and the shots worked well. you have a good concept. Not sure if there was more water, but for me, even more water in the picture would have increased the impact of this shot. Making it a B&amp;W might also work? <br/>Good idea!<br/></td>', 'I recently saw some art photos of lone persons in the middle of totally empty and seemingly vast oceans, sand beaches, parking lots...and the shots worked well. you have a good concept. Not sure if there was more water, but for me, even more water in the picture would have increased the impact of this shot. Making it a B&W might also work? Good idea!', '2005-07-18 02:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542732, 204847, 28742, '<td valign="top">Where''s the spaghetti? :)</td>', 'Where''s the spaghetti? :)', '2005-07-18 02:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542734, 202432, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The huge bus ad detracts a lot, but what can ya do. The guy in the upper left is diostracting and out of place - could crop him out.</td>', 'Nice shot. The huge bus ad detracts a lot, but what can ya do. The guy in the upper left is diostracting and out of place - could crop him out.', '2005-07-18 02:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542737, 203336, 28742, '<td valign="top">Correct me if I am wrong, but isn''t that David Letterman? ;-)</td>', 'Correct me if I am wrong, but isn''t that David Letterman? ;-)', '2005-07-18 02:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542746, 204164, 28742, '<td valign="top">Looks like yours got away from ya! Hehehee. Cool shot, GF. Anxious to see how it was done.</td>', 'Looks like yours got away from ya! Hehehee. Cool shot, GF. Anxious to see how it was done.', '2005-07-18 02:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542756, 203814, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well, ya compelled an audible "Awwwww" out of me! This is fantastic. You just need to write a nice personal note or poem on the left there and frame it for her. Beautiful! 10</td>', 'Well, ya compelled an audible "Awwwww" out of me! This is fantastic. You just need to write a nice personal note or poem on the left there and frame it for her. Beautiful! 10', '2005-07-18 02:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542758, 204787, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice Image...8</td>', 'Nice Image...8', '2005-07-18 02:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1542759, 204515, 28742, '<td valign="top">She is adorable! A loud "Awwww" from me. :)</td>', 'She is adorable! A loud "Awwww" from me. :)', '2005-07-18 02:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
