(1542770, 204861, 37409, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo. I think it he had been on a more neutral color sofa it would have had more impact.</td>', 'Sharp photo. I think it he had been on a more neutral color sofa it would have had more impact.', '2005-07-18 02:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
