(1544075, 204845, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like the motion blur, it does capture the mood well.  my suggestion would be for your model to have her head back a little more with her feet kicked out more so it has more of a free-flying mood.  the feeling i get from it right now is hanging on for dear life.</td>', 'i like the motion blur, it does capture the mood well.  my suggestion would be for your model to have her head back a little more with her feet kicked out more so it has more of a free-flying mood.  the feeling i get from it right now is hanging on for dear life.', '2005-07-18 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544113, 204889, 27789, '<td valign="top">despite the subject being a little blurred, the photo is technically ''right'' as far as composition, leading lines, etc.  But it has a static feel for a picture of a racer.</td>', 'despite the subject being a little blurred, the photo is technically ''right'' as far as composition, leading lines, etc.  But it has a static feel for a picture of a racer.', '2005-07-18 15:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544120, 204419, 27789, '<td valign="top">i''ve never tried shooting something like this, but a couple things that might increase the drama would be lowering your camera angle so the rider was above the line of the trees, and opening the photo up to the right a little more to give him more space and so he''s less centered.  I like the rider''s pose, the DOF, lighting.</td>', 'i''ve never tried shooting something like this, but a couple things that might increase the drama would be lowering your camera angle so the rider was above the line of the trees, and opening the photo up to the right a little more to give him more space and so he''s less centered.  I like the rider''s pose, the DOF, lighting.', '2005-07-18 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544122, 204043, 27789, '<td valign="top">nice chioce of silhouette for this shot.  the forms are very interesting, particularly the ship.  The cropping feels a little weird to me, like the right side could be cropped a little.  Maybe it''s just the tree that bothers me a little bit.</td>', 'nice chioce of silhouette for this shot.  the forms are very interesting, particularly the ship.  The cropping feels a little weird to me, like the right side could be cropped a little.  Maybe it''s just the tree that bothers me a little bit.', '2005-07-18 15:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
