(1544127, 204752, 27789, '<td valign="top">nice capture of these colors.  The background looks a little too cluttered, maybe a shallower DOF would  help.  I can''t decide if I like the border, the yellow line in it seems to be throwing me off.</td>', 'nice capture of these colors.  The background looks a little too cluttered, maybe a shallower DOF would  help.  I can''t decide if I like the border, the yellow line in it seems to be throwing me off.', '2005-07-18 15:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544130, 204241, 27789, '<td valign="top">what an interesting photograph.  it makes me curious about the story behind it.  the color of her foot is a little distracting.</td>', 'what an interesting photograph.  it makes me curious about the story behind it.  the color of her foot is a little distracting.', '2005-07-18 15:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544134, 204619, 27789, '<td valign="top">interesting face.  the blown-out background hurts the picture though.</td>', 'interesting face.  the blown-out background hurts the picture though.', '2005-07-18 15:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544136, 204817, 2780, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be a nice photo but the post-processing needs a lot of work! I''m guessing you tried to make it look like Dusk when it really wasn''t, by making the colours like a sunset. In fact what you''ve ended up with is an awful mix of green and unnatural pink. Ignoring the fact that the colour is so bad, the halo around the treeline and the pond weeds is very distracting, and was probably caused by poor application of USM with too wide of a radius. The detail in the grass in the foreground seems to have almost disappeared, maybe due to excessive neat-image or other noise-removing technique? I really think the post-processing totally ruins this shot. A simple B&amp;W with more careful sharpening would be much more appealing.</td>', 'This looks like it could be a nice photo but the post-processing needs a lot of work! I''m guessing you tried to make it look like Dusk when it really wasn''t, by making the colours like a sunset. In fact what you''ve ended up with is an awful mix of green and unnatural pink. Ignoring the fact that the colour is so bad, the halo around the treeline and the pond weeds is very distracting, and was probably caused by poor application of USM with too wide of a radius. The detail in the grass in the foreground seems to have almost disappeared, maybe due to excessive neat-image or other noise-removing technique? I really think the post-processing totally ruins this shot. A simple B&W with more careful sharpening would be much more appealing.', '2005-07-18 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544139, 204015, 27789, '<td valign="top">has a nice ''candid'' feel to it.  but the shot doesn''t hold enough interest, it doesn''t say how the girl feels about waiting in line, whether she''s anxious, board, etc.</td>', 'has a nice ''candid'' feel to it.  but the shot doesn''t hold enough interest, it doesn''t say how the girl feels about waiting in line, whether she''s anxious, board, etc.', '2005-07-18 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544143, 202432, 27789, '<td valign="top">i really like the juxtaposition, the little child hoping to one day be a real player.  maybe you had no control over the kid, but it would have been nice if he had been watching the players admiringly, or even immitating them.  the guy in the top left corner is really distracting, it would have been nice if you could photoshp him out.  good title.</td>', 'i really like the juxtaposition, the little child hoping to one day be a real player.  maybe you had no control over the kid, but it would have been nice if he had been watching the players admiringly, or even immitating them.  the guy in the top left corner is really distracting, it would have been nice if you could photoshp him out.  good title.', '2005-07-18 15:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1544145, 204800, 27789, '<td valign="top">feels a little underexposed.  I also think it hurts not having the sail up.</td>', 'feels a little underexposed.  I also think it hurts not having the sail up.', '2005-07-18 15:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
