(1545711, 204864, 27605, '<td valign="top">Great POV.... looks like you must''ve been in a dinghy?!   Great subtle color, exquisitely lit, very well composed.  Bump to (9), good luck!</td>', 'Great POV.... looks like you must''ve been in a dinghy?!   Great subtle color, exquisitely lit, very well composed.  Bump to (9), good luck!', '2005-07-19 07:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545785, 204479, 36616, '<td valign="top">I suspect you are probably a "newbie" to this site. Use a full 640 pixels so that we can see as much detail as possible. It looks like a nice pic with some overblown highlights - very difficult shot. Glück</td>', 'I suspect you are probably a "newbie" to this site. Use a full 640 pixels so that we can see as much detail as possible. It looks like a nice pic with some overblown highlights - very difficult shot. Glück', '2005-07-19 08:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545790, 203731, 36616, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing. well done. I find it difficult to believe that the balloon can be so much faster than gravity and will be interested to see what set up you used. My pick for the blue - 10</td>', 'Perfect timing. well done. I find it difficult to believe that the balloon can be so much faster than gravity and will be interested to see what set up you used. My pick for the blue - 10', '2005-07-19 08:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
