(1545906, 204814, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and the whole idea, I just think it could have been more evenly lit as the bright wall beneath the stairs really screams out for attention so you don´t quite notice the baby straight away.  One of the better shots in the challenge, I gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like this shot and the whole idea, I just think it could have been more evenly lit as the bright wall beneath the stairs really screams out for attention so you don´t quite notice the baby straight away.  One of the better shots in the challenge, I gave it a 7.', '2005-07-19 09:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545911, 204635, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  I like this idea and oddly I feel sympathetic for the "little green nut", you scored some points for humour from me :o)</td>', 'Lol!  I like this idea and oddly I feel sympathetic for the "little green nut", you scored some points for humour from me :o)', '2005-07-19 09:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545914, 204858, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a polarizer, too bad this challenge was with basic editing as those clouds could have been a killer with some dodge/burn but very very nice nevertheless.</td>', 'Nice use of a polarizer, too bad this challenge was with basic editing as those clouds could have been a killer with some dodge/burn but very very nice nevertheless.', '2005-07-19 09:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545921, 202775, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot is very nice but the fact that you cut off her feet is a real eyesore here and IMO is a BIG no no.  Other than that, love this shot, very nice colours, contrast and DOF.</td>', 'This shot is very nice but the fact that you cut off her feet is a real eyesore here and IMO is a BIG no no.  Other than that, love this shot, very nice colours, contrast and DOF.', '2005-07-19 09:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1545926, 204488, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W, great skin tones and sharpness.  However I can´t really make out what he/she is holding, is it a garden hose?</td>', 'Nice B/W, great skin tones and sharpness.  However I can´t really make out what he/she is holding, is it a garden hose?', '2005-07-19 09:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
