(1546216, 204164, 25397, '<td valign="top">Greetings Dan<br/>Great take on the challenge and best of luck with this awesome image than only you would pull off. :-)</td>', 'Greetings DanGreat take on the challenge and best of luck with this awesome image than only you would pull off. :-)', '2005-07-19 12:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546254, 203397, 39684, '<td valign="top">Great Concept, I love it! Very original.</td>', 'Great Concept, I love it! Very original.', '2005-07-19 13:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546262, 204522, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, I like how clear it is, most shots I have taken at that altitude were from a commercial airliner and had lots of haze due to the altitude and also were taken through a poor window (image quality wise) so this is pretty cool.</td>', 'Pretty nice, I like how clear it is, most shots I have taken at that altitude were from a commercial airliner and had lots of haze due to the altitude and also were taken through a poor window (image quality wise) so this is pretty cool.', '2005-07-19 13:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546280, 203336, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... that dude looks suspiciously like Jay Leno :o)<br/> <br/>Anyway, a nice Candid shot, above average in the challenge but it´s not blowing my socks off either, needs IMHO more even lighting across the face.  Gave it a 7.</td>', 'Hmmm... that dude looks suspiciously like Jay Leno :o) Anyway, a nice Candid shot, above average in the challenge but it´s not blowing my socks off either, needs IMHO more even lighting across the face.  Gave it a 7.', '2005-07-19 13:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546288, 204618, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad effort at all but compared to Nico_Blue´s image in the Fantasy challenge this isn´t quite as good, keep it up though, you are on to something.</td>', 'Not a bad effort at all but compared to Nico_Blue´s image in the Fantasy challenge this isn´t quite as good, keep it up though, you are on to something.', '2005-07-19 13:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546294, 202167, 27482, '<td valign="top">DOF too shallow for my taste, I would have liked to see the whole sentence "Petition for divorce" and the rings in focus but other than that, pretty good.  I especially like the tones in the image.</td>', 'DOF too shallow for my taste, I would have liked to see the whole sentence "Petition for divorce" and the rings in focus but other than that, pretty good.  I especially like the tones in the image.', '2005-07-19 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546301, 202708, 27482, '<td valign="top">Validated or not, I just don´t really care for the "look" of this image or what you did with it in post processing, just wanted to explain why I only gave it a 4.  I would have rated it a 6 or even a 7 if the plane had been sharper and you would have had a clear deep blue sky in the backround, not this grayish haze.</td>', 'Validated or not, I just don´t really care for the "look" of this image or what you did with it in post processing, just wanted to explain why I only gave it a 4.  I would have rated it a 6 or even a 7 if the plane had been sharper and you would have had a clear deep blue sky in the backround, not this grayish haze.', '2005-07-19 13:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546304, 204798, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very nice, like the composition.  However I don´t really care for the pink clouds, the colour of the sand and the sea are however very nice, if that tonal range would have been consistent in the whole image (it probably is, but the clouds at least appear pink to me) I would have given this shot the highest score so far this challenge and I have voted on almost half of it.  Still very good in my books.</td>', 'Very nice, like the composition.  However I don´t really care for the pink clouds, the colour of the sand and the sea are however very nice, if that tonal range would have been consistent in the whole image (it probably is, but the clouds at least appear pink to me) I would have given this shot the highest score so far this challenge and I have voted on almost half of it.  Still very good in my books.', '2005-07-19 13:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
