(1546410, 202708, 40855, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a pic, but two problems: 1) Photo is too soft, 2) The plane has a ''halo'' around it (post-processing artefact?)</td>', 'Good idea for a pic, but two problems: 1) Photo is too soft, 2) The plane has a ''halo'' around it (post-processing artefact?)', '2005-07-19 13:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546427, 203783, 40855, '<td valign="top">Very good photo, I personally like photos that use one color predominantly, blue in your case. Perhaps I''d have like to see in framed horizontally rather than vertically. It''s also may just a bit too dark.</td>', 'Very good photo, I personally like photos that use one color predominantly, blue in your case. Perhaps I''d have like to see in framed horizontally rather than vertically. It''s also may just a bit too dark.', '2005-07-19 14:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
