(1546444, 203814, 40855, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo: perfect colors, contrast and exposure. Faming of the model is great, using the out of focus sea as a background. This pic definitely evokes a mood, just not sure it''s ''Independence''. But well done.<br/> <br/> <br/>Like the fact that the model is facing away</td>', 'Very nice photo: perfect colors, contrast and exposure. Faming of the model is great, using the out of focus sea as a background. This pic definitely evokes a mood, just not sure it''s ''Independence''. But well done.  Like the fact that the model is facing away', '2005-07-19 14:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1546445, 202314, 37215, '<td valign="top">chick looks a bit fuzzy - did he move? idea v good, composition good</td>', 'chick looks a bit fuzzy - did he move? idea v good, composition good', '2005-07-19 14:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
