(1550774, 204635, 16632, '<td valign="top">MAN :))) This is great !!!! I love this ideea, and I say that you definitely should win with it ! I just love it :)<br/>//www.moszi.net</td>', 'MAN :))) This is great !!!! I love this ideea, and I say that you definitely should win with it ! I just love it :)//www.moszi.net', '2005-07-20 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
