(1550820, 202588, 24976, '<td valign="top">i think this would fit better in the textures challenge... but nice tones and contrast just seems a bit off topic to me imo.</td>', 'i think this would fit better in the textures challenge... but nice tones and contrast just seems a bit off topic to me imo.', '2005-07-20 16:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
