(1550832, 203336, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice character study...interesting composition and nice use of light and shadow give the image  extra impact.</td>', 'This is a really nice character study...interesting composition and nice use of light and shadow give the image  extra impact.', '2005-07-20 16:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550865, 203477, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Crop, color, POV, focus, all excellent. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Crop, color, POV, focus, all excellent. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 16:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550868, 203814, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love this!  skin is a little red toned for my taste, but the POV,  DOF, composition and other tones make up for it.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love this!  skin is a little red toned for my taste, but the POV,  DOF, composition and other tones make up for it.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 16:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550871, 204862, 34192, '<td valign="top">Great tones!  Excellent crop, composition, DOF.  Not crazy about the angle at the top but I know its hard for the POV this is taken at.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great tones!  Excellent crop, composition, DOF.  Not crazy about the angle at the top but I know its hard for the POV this is taken at.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550875, 203735, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wish the sidewalk wasn''t os white but at the same time I like how the closer sidewalk is a different color - adds to the perception of separation here.  Well done!  8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wish the sidewalk wasn''t os white but at the same time I like how the closer sidewalk is a different color - adds to the perception of separation here.  Well done!  8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550880, 203495, 34192, '<td valign="top">Great face!  Good tones.  Maybe crop the bottom just a little  for better vertical balance - he looks like he''s being pushed up in the picture.  Course, could be my own perception problem.  :) 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great face!  Good tones.  Maybe crop the bottom just a little  for better vertical balance - he looks like he''s being pushed up in the picture.  Course, could be my own perception problem.  :) 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550883, 204798, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent tones used.  love the coloring in the sky.  Like the details in her coat - catches your eye and gives her depth so she isn''t just a black blob. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'excellent tones used.  love the coloring in the sky.  Like the details in her coat - catches your eye and gives her depth so she isn''t just a black blob. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 17:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550885, 204845, 40526, '<td valign="top">great moviment</td>', 'great moviment', '2005-07-20 17:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550940, 204757, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but the image you have chosen to take is a very cluttered image. Too much distraction in the background</td>', 'Nice subject, but the image you have chosen to take is a very cluttered image. Too much distraction in the background', '2005-07-20 17:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550943, 202588, 5354, '<td valign="top">I''d like this more if it wasn''t so ''bright'' in the highlights</td>', 'I''d like this more if it wasn''t so ''bright'' in the highlights', '2005-07-20 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550949, 204786, 5354, '<td valign="top">nice bird, but the white background is too stark for me</td>', 'nice bird, but the white background is too stark for me', '2005-07-20 17:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550954, 203969, 5354, '<td valign="top">Feels too over processed for my liking. I guess this is going to fall into the love it / hate it category</td>', 'Feels too over processed for my liking. I guess this is going to fall into the love it / hate it category', '2005-07-20 17:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550959, 204784, 5354, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Jurasic Park !</td>', 'Reminds me of Jurasic Park !', '2005-07-20 17:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550981, 204178, 23203, '<td valign="top">As a viewer, this appears a bit cluttered to me. I see how you tried to show the pink differentiated from the green.It might help to zoom in some.</td>', 'As a viewer, this appears a bit cluttered to me. I see how you tried to show the pink differentiated from the green.It might help to zoom in some.', '2005-07-20 17:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550985, 204516, 23203, '<td valign="top">Both subjects have their face partly in shadow. Another angle could have helped.<br/></td>', 'Both subjects have their face partly in shadow. Another angle could have helped.', '2005-07-20 17:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550990, 204860, 23203, '<td valign="top">Well done.<br/>If I would change anything- it would be some extra sharpening.<br/></td>', 'Well done.If I would change anything- it would be some extra sharpening.', '2005-07-20 17:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550993, 203735, 23203, '<td valign="top">Too much detail in this. The person in the bottom right could be cropped out. Also some parts appear a little overblown.<br/></td>', 'Too much detail in this. The person in the bottom right could be cropped out. Also some parts appear a little overblown.', '2005-07-20 17:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1550997, 204797, 23203, '<td valign="top">Well taken.<br/>If I would change something - it would be the placing of the thing at right edge, its partly covering the face.<br/></td>', 'Well taken.If I would change something - it would be the placing of the thing at right edge, its partly covering the face.', '2005-07-20 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551003, 202394, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The only nitpick is the white "streak" on the top-right side (something behind the flag, it seems?) as well as the shadow in top-middle area. Maybe increase the saturation to make the picture "pop"? Other than these, excellent and refreshing picture of good ol'' USA flag!</td>', 'Very nice! The only nitpick is the white "streak" on the top-right side (something behind the flag, it seems?) as well as the shadow in top-middle area. Maybe increase the saturation to make the picture "pop"? Other than these, excellent and refreshing picture of good ol'' USA flag!', '2005-07-20 17:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551007, 204658, 23203, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I would crop out the bottom as it is distracting.<br/></td>', 'Good concept. I would crop out the bottom as it is distracting.', '2005-07-20 17:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551009, 204832, 23203, '<td valign="top">Free as a fly! Nice macro. 10<br/></td>', 'Free as a fly! Nice macro. 10', '2005-07-20 17:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551016, 204608, 23203, '<td valign="top">The main subject has too little detail for this photograph to work well.<br/></td>', 'The main subject has too little detail for this photograph to work well.', '2005-07-20 17:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551024, 204618, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very nice execution of something that''s been done before. Kind of disappointed that the praying guy isn''t sharp enough. (I imagine it''s due to long exposure.) I think the crop is cut too tightly; more blackness around the image would probably help make it look better. Kudos!</td>', 'Very nice execution of something that''s been done before. Kind of disappointed that the praying guy isn''t sharp enough. (I imagine it''s due to long exposure.) I think the crop is cut too tightly; more blackness around the image would probably help make it look better. Kudos!', '2005-07-20 18:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551059, 204784, 23203, '<td valign="top">The grass in front of the subject is sharper than the subject itself. <br/></td>', 'The grass in front of the subject is sharper than the subject itself. ', '2005-07-20 18:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551063, 204800, 23203, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. The image appears too greyish - I''ve had the same problem on photographing seascapes on overcast days. Maybe try playing with levels some? Or use a polarizer?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice concept. The image appears too greyish - I''ve had the same problem on photographing seascapes on overcast days. Maybe try playing with levels some? Or use a polarizer? ', '2005-07-20 18:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551080, 204846, 23203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.. wish her eyes were open though.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful photo.. wish her eyes were open though.', '2005-07-20 18:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551093, 204845, 23203, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried panning shot once and found it too hard.. but some photogs on dpc do it really well. Nice attempt, would look better if the motion blur was completely in the background and not in the subject. I''ll score this a 7<br/></td>', 'I''ve tried panning shot once and found it too hard.. but some photogs on dpc do it really well. Nice attempt, would look better if the motion blur was completely in the background and not in the subject. I''ll score this a 7', '2005-07-20 18:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551104, 204561, 23203, '<td valign="top">Looks somewhat overexposed (high ISO setting?)<br/>Converting to grayscale partially saved it, though.<br/></td>', 'Looks somewhat overexposed (high ISO setting?)Converting to grayscale partially saved it, though.', '2005-07-20 18:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551191, 203653, 37719, '<td valign="top">But she is not alone....nice shot.  I can see you like B/W.  Well done!</td>', 'But she is not alone....nice shot.  I can see you like B/W.  Well done!', '2005-07-20 19:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551252, 204832, 36495, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge, eh?</td>', 'Wrong challenge, eh?', '2005-07-20 19:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551358, 202708, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but the haloing on this is just too much.  if you have an image where basic editing constraints leave it looking like this, you probably would be better off sitting the challenge out.</td>', 'sorry, but the haloing on this is just too much.  if you have an image where basic editing constraints leave it looking like this, you probably would be better off sitting the challenge out.', '2005-07-20 20:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551374, 202167, 27789, '<td valign="top">b&amp;w and composition work well for this.  the focus is a little shallower than i would have chosen, but not off-putting.  the out-of-focus ring is a little distracting though, where it sticks up so much, and is in the foreground but still out of focus.</td>', 'b&w and composition work well for this.  the focus is a little shallower than i would have chosen, but not off-putting.  the out-of-focus ring is a little distracting though, where it sticks up so much, and is in the foreground but still out of focus.', '2005-07-20 20:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551375, 203336, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Is that Jay Leno?  Regardless, the lighting is great, the DOF and POV excellent as is the focus.  I love the crop - I think it adds to the mood of the image and works well witht he tone. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I really like this.  Is that Jay Leno?  Regardless, the lighting is great, the DOF and POV excellent as is the focus.  I love the crop - I think it adds to the mood of the image and works well witht he tone. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 20:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551377, 204535, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like it, the angle where the wall is pushing down on him a little, and he''s just pushing back at it.  good mood to the photo.</td>', 'i like it, the angle where the wall is pushing down on him a little, and he''s just pushing back at it.  good mood to the photo.', '2005-07-20 20:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551383, 204850, 27789, '<td valign="top">really interesting background.  the composition is good, but the picture seems to be lacking something.  maybe it looks a little tooo shut in with the wall of logs.  i''m not getting tranquility much from the picture.</td>', 'really interesting background.  the composition is good, but the picture seems to be lacking something.  maybe it looks a little tooo shut in with the wall of logs.  i''m not getting tranquility much from the picture.', '2005-07-20 20:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551386, 204777, 27789, '<td valign="top">the background works well for me, but the out of focus parts of the flower are distracting.  it''d be nice if the entire flower was in focus, though that may have brought the background into more focus than you wanted.</td>', 'the background works well for me, but the out of focus parts of the flower are distracting.  it''d be nice if the entire flower was in focus, though that may have brought the background into more focus than you wanted.', '2005-07-20 20:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551389, 204437, 27789, '<td valign="top">technically well executed.  What if you had someone in the reflection reading it, that may have added more interest and meaning depending on who it was reading</td>', 'technically well executed.  What if you had someone in the reflection reading it, that may have added more interest and meaning depending on who it was reading', '2005-07-20 20:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551484, 204844, 40386, '<td valign="top">Very patriotic!!  I love the use of the red white and blue.  Unique and well thought out.</td>', 'Very patriotic!!  I love the use of the red white and blue.  Unique and well thought out.', '2005-07-20 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551487, 204797, 40386, '<td valign="top">This shot was well thought out, very patriotic, puts a lump in my throat.  God bless all those fighting for our independence.  Fits the catagory perfectly.</td>', 'This shot was well thought out, very patriotic, puts a lump in my throat.  God bless all those fighting for our independence.  Fits the catagory perfectly.', '2005-07-20 21:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551492, 204078, 40386, '<td valign="top">Wow beautiful shot.  Not too sure how it fits the catagory of Independence, maybe I am just being shortsighted LOL.</td>', 'Wow beautiful shot.  Not too sure how it fits the catagory of Independence, maybe I am just being shortsighted LOL.', '2005-07-20 21:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551493, 204864, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, am returning to bump it a point; but I wish it had more color, even just a little more</td>', 'I really like this shot, am returning to bump it a point; but I wish it had more color, even just a little more', '2005-07-20 21:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551495, 203731, 40386, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative.  Great shot.</td>', 'Very imaginative.  Great shot.', '2005-07-20 21:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551505, 204659, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, am returning to bump it a point; but I wish it was just a bit sharper and don''t understand why it is B&amp;W</td>', 'I really like this shot, am returning to bump it a point; but I wish it was just a bit sharper and don''t understand why it is B&W', '2005-07-20 21:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551518, 202708, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, pity about the soft focus.</td>', 'Nice shot, pity about the soft focus.', '2005-07-20 21:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551559, 204776, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love this image.  Something very peaceful about it.  I think if the feet were traveling away and barefoot it would be a perfect 10.  Cliche, I know, but what can  I say?  Think the crop is well done.  Can''t tell you if it would do better with sky or not.  Creatively good also.  Colors/tones not too strong but  part of that is lighting part of it is sand is just not that interesting.  7 - Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love this image.  Something very peaceful about it.  I think if the feet were traveling away and barefoot it would be a perfect 10.  Cliche, I know, but what can  I say?  Think the crop is well done.  Can''t tell you if it would do better with sky or not.  Creatively good also.  Colors/tones not too strong but  part of that is lighting part of it is sand is just not that interesting.  7 - Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 21:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551565, 204818, 34192, '<td valign="top">Technically this is a great image in most respects - focus excellent, colors/tones great, DOF, POV excellent.  However,  I am not a fan of using a technique when there doesn''t seem to be a need.  I don''t know why the image is tilted but I just have an urge to straighten it out.  Thats my opinion of course but I feel the image would be improved without the weird angle.  7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Technically this is a great image in most respects - focus excellent, colors/tones great, DOF, POV excellent.  However,  I am not a fan of using a technique when there doesn''t seem to be a need.  I don''t know why the image is tilted but I just have an urge to straighten it out.  Thats my opinion of course but I feel the image would be improved without the weird angle.  7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 21:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551577, 202751, 34192, '<td valign="top">Right now as it is, this image is okay.  It could be incredible with a little post processing to give it a mood.  The lighting doesn''t enhance the image so I think post processing in some drama would really help.  Also, it would be more effective if the subjects feet were actually walking instead of standing there as if waiting.  I think this image has a lot of potential that just needs to be brought out.  Love the inclusion of the fence - I think it adds. 6 - Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Right now as it is, this image is okay.  It could be incredible with a little post processing to give it a mood.  The lighting doesn''t enhance the image so I think post processing in some drama would really help.  Also, it would be more effective if the subjects feet were actually walking instead of standing there as if waiting.  I think this image has a lot of potential that just needs to be brought out.  Love the inclusion of the fence - I think it adds. 6 - Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 21:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551585, 202165, 34192, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  I must have missed this my first pass through.  Everything about it works and works well.  Tone, POV, DOF, focus, composition.  Wow.  Bumping to 10 and marking as a favorite.  Thanks!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Amazing.  I must have missed this my first pass through.  Everything about it works and works well.  Tone, POV, DOF, focus, composition.  Wow.  Bumping to 10 and marking as a favorite.  Thanks!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-20 22:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551802, 203436, 39737, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the dark shadows and warm bright color.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the dark shadows and warm bright color.  Good job.', '2005-07-20 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551845, 204468, 24976, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites. 10</td>', 'one of my favourites. 10', '2005-07-20 23:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551895, 204561, 40655, '<td valign="top">nice photo. good job<br/></td>', 'nice photo. good job', '2005-07-21 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551899, 202314, 40655, '<td valign="top">very cute :o)</td>', 'very cute :o)', '2005-07-21 00:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1551990, 203814, 10432, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the white dress and the deep blue of the water.  Lovely image.  I like how this fits the challenge, as well.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the white dress and the deep blue of the water.  Lovely image.  I like how this fits the challenge, as well.', '2005-07-21 01:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552111, 203889, 35827, '<td valign="top">amazing photo!!! Great model, great composition, great color, great photo, great great great great!!!!</td>', 'amazing photo!!! Great model, great composition, great color, great photo, great great great great!!!!', '2005-07-21 02:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552123, 203731, 30247, '<td valign="top">one word...incredible</td>', 'one word...incredible', '2005-07-21 03:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552124, 202751, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this photo...of someone going their own way. The white fence/road moving "up ahead" helps with the idea as does the guitar! But I do wonder if it might work better in black and white? Also, not much you could do about that but to me, the telephone poles (?) break the solitary "magic" of the photo...<br/>Well done</td>', 'I really like the concept of this photo...of someone going their own way. The white fence/road moving "up ahead" helps with the idea as does the guitar! But I do wonder if it might work better in black and white? Also, not much you could do about that but to me, the telephone poles (?) break the solitary "magic" of the photo...Well done', '2005-07-21 03:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552128, 204798, 30247, '<td valign="top">would have been better if span of sea had covered a little more..but the horizon is still visible so .....not bad.....nice indeed</td>', 'would have been better if span of sea had covered a little more..but the horizon is still visible so .....not bad.....nice indeed', '2005-07-21 03:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552130, 204845, 39483, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I like that she''s barefoot! The composition is great and the blury background adds a nice effect although it might be a bit over bluried? Conveys well  the idea of independence, especially the barefeet part :) <br/>I often am curious how some photos look in black and white? It helps take the focus away from the colors of the subject''s clothes, the background...and puts it on the action or the composition...<br/>In any case, well done<br/></td>', 'Nice shot! I like that she''s barefoot! The composition is great and the blury background adds a nice effect although it might be a bit over bluried? Conveys well  the idea of independence, especially the barefeet part :) I often am curious how some photos look in black and white? It helps take the focus away from the colors of the subject''s clothes, the background...and puts it on the action or the composition...In any case, well done', '2005-07-21 03:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552225, 204164, 8643, '<td valign="top">Just brilliant - great concept (as always), beautifully executed!</td>', 'Just brilliant - great concept (as always), beautifully executed!', '2005-07-21 06:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552309, 204756, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this image and I don''t like this image.  I love the serendipity of the image as it is.  At the same time I don''t like the shirtless older man.  I don''t know - I think I see this as two images in one.  Let me go back.  I think the stong parts of this image are the lighting, the wall texture and tone, the contrasting textures and tones of the girl and her scooter.  The redness of the man, his awkward position, take away the -for lack of a better word - gentleness of the scene.  All those elements pull together very nicely.  Then again, the juxtaposition of a shirtless man lends something altogether different to the image. It definitely creates tension.  Maybe if he wasn''t so red.  I don''t mind the red hat at all.  His skin tones just pull my eyes right to him at the detriment of the rest of the image.  That''s about as well as I can put my finger on it.  Sorry! 8 - Good luck in teh challenge!</td>', 'I like this image and I don''t like this image.  I love the serendipity of the image as it is.  At the same time I don''t like the shirtless older man.  I don''t know - I think I see this as two images in one.  Let me go back.  I think the stong parts of this image are the lighting, the wall texture and tone, the contrasting textures and tones of the girl and her scooter.  The redness of the man, his awkward position, take away the -for lack of a better word - gentleness of the scene.  All those elements pull together very nicely.  Then again, the juxtaposition of a shirtless man lends something altogether different to the image. It definitely creates tension.  Maybe if he wasn''t so red.  I don''t mind the red hat at all.  His skin tones just pull my eyes right to him at the detriment of the rest of the image.  That''s about as well as I can put my finger on it.  Sorry! 8 - Good luck in teh challenge!', '2005-07-21 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1552312, 204516, 34192, '<td valign="top">You will probably think this is odd.  Each time I see this image, especially in thumbnail, I think of a gallows.  I think it is the overpoweringly geometric in your face of the wood.  The moon is not really that stong - I look and move on.  The placing of the two men reinforces the ''gallow'' sense I get.  The only thing that pulls me away fromt hat is when I look hard at their faces.  So, for me at least, this image works on a much more subtle level than I think you may have intended.  Hey - that''s good for you, yes?  The lighting in this image is not the greatest - harsh sunlight - but we work with what we have.  I think this would be interesting to re-visit on a dreary day, framed the same, without the smiles.  Maybe not.  But I find this image intriguing and forcing a second, third, and fourth look. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'You will probably think this is odd.  Each time I see this image, especially in thumbnail, I think of a gallows.  I think it is the overpoweringly geometric in your face of the wood.  The moon is not really that stong - I look and move on.  The placing of the two men reinforces the ''gallow'' sense I get.  The only thing that pulls me away fromt hat is when I look hard at their faces.  So, for me at least, this image works on a much more subtle level than I think you may have intended.  Hey - that''s good for you, yes?  The lighting in this image is not the greatest - harsh sunlight - but we work with what we have.  I think this would be interesting to re-visit on a dreary day, framed the same, without the smiles.  Maybe not.  But I find this image intriguing and forcing a second, third, and fourth look. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-21 08:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
