(1553936, 204818, 13688, '<td valign="top">perhaps you''re joking or  perhaps they''ve been fitted with a one of those newer, slimmer, more portable ball and chains.  as far as the pic goes, the focus is nice on the flowers though i''m not sure that should be the main attraction.  maybe a smaller ap and stepping back to get everything in focus would help for me.  also too bad you had such a distracting background to work with</td>', 'perhaps you''re joking or  perhaps they''ve been fitted with a one of those newer, slimmer, more portable ball and chains.  as far as the pic goes, the focus is nice on the flowers though i''m not sure that should be the main attraction.  maybe a smaller ap and stepping back to get everything in focus would help for me.  also too bad you had such a distracting background to work with', '2005-07-21 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1553949, 204603, 13688, '<td valign="top">good crisp focus.  unfortunately, it brings out alot of what appears to be dust issues.  i would have liked to not have the main subject upside down as it makes it hard to look at for me.  he looks like he staring off in a longing sort of way.  perhaps you could have used that in a composition to more inhance your point, other than just all of the currency itself</td>', 'good crisp focus.  unfortunately, it brings out alot of what appears to be dust issues.  i would have liked to not have the main subject upside down as it makes it hard to look at for me.  he looks like he staring off in a longing sort of way.  perhaps you could have used that in a composition to more inhance your point, other than just all of the currency itself', '2005-07-21 23:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1553955, 202588, 33392, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good entry for the textures challenge.<br/>The photo seems a bit bright, but that may just be dirt - in any case, I like the idea of the closeup.  I wish the eyes were more visible.  They look kindof sad.</td>', 'This would have been a good entry for the textures challenge.The photo seems a bit bright, but that may just be dirt - in any case, I like the idea of the closeup.  I wish the eyes were more visible.  They look kindof sad.', '2005-07-21 23:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
