(1553969, 204817, 33392, '<td valign="top">The pink tones don''t do much for me.  I think I would really like this with a more natural color set.  Even B/W.  Just not pink.</td>', 'The pink tones don''t do much for me.  I think I would really like this with a more natural color set.  Even B/W.  Just not pink.', '2005-07-21 23:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1553972, 204817, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice composition and feel to this shot.  i wish the colors were a bit more subdued.  perhaps a nice warm colored duotone would really enhance the feeling of the moment. but what do i know i''ve never done duotone coloring before.   the leading line to the fisherman is quite nice as well.  the more i look, the more that stick in the foreground bothers me...perhaps you could have broke it off...i''ll stop now.</td>', 'nice composition and feel to this shot.  i wish the colors were a bit more subdued.  perhaps a nice warm colored duotone would really enhance the feeling of the moment. but what do i know i''ve never done duotone coloring before.   the leading line to the fisherman is quite nice as well.  the more i look, the more that stick in the foreground bothers me...perhaps you could have broke it off...i''ll stop now.', '2005-07-21 23:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
