(1553998, 204614, 13688, '<td valign="top">good idea.  i would have exposed more for the sky...it feels a bit blown out to me.  and i don''t think the stone work would have been hurt by a bit more underexposure.   if you had the ability to change your aperture, i think it would have been nice to increase it and  throw the trees as out of focus as possible or tighten it so everything was crisp.  though i understand how hard it is to judge something like that looking at the camera''s screen</td>', 'good idea.  i would have exposed more for the sky...it feels a bit blown out to me.  and i don''t think the stone work would have been hurt by a bit more underexposure.   if you had the ability to change your aperture, i think it would have been nice to increase it and  throw the trees as out of focus as possible or tighten it so everything was crisp.  though i understand how hard it is to judge something like that looking at the camera''s screen', '2005-07-21 23:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554020, 204789, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think you''ve done a great job of capturing her head strongness.  many probably won''t like the soft focus on  the face...i find it very intriguing, once again adding to the personality of the shot.  i think that asphalt line could have been problematic, but your choice of composition has handled it well...i find it very complementary to her eyes.</td>', 'i think you''ve done a great job of capturing her head strongness.  many probably won''t like the soft focus on  the face...i find it very intriguing, once again adding to the personality of the shot.  i think that asphalt line could have been problematic, but your choice of composition has handled it well...i find it very complementary to her eyes.', '2005-07-21 23:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554030, 204710, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure what that big piece of paper is, but i''ll take a wild guess at registration.  unfortunately it looses some of that independence feel when you think of licenses, registrations, and insurance being required.  perhaps you could have found a cooler looking key chain, and perhaps replaced the distracting would grain background with a white or solid color.   not that your idea wasn''t sound, when i saw this shot i thought of another one where the parent is passing the car key to the teenager as he heads out the door on a date...not sure how hard that would have been to set up, if even a possibility, but perhaps a more exotic alternative.</td>', 'i''m not sure what that big piece of paper is, but i''ll take a wild guess at registration.  unfortunately it looses some of that independence feel when you think of licenses, registrations, and insurance being required.  perhaps you could have found a cooler looking key chain, and perhaps replaced the distracting would grain background with a white or solid color.   not that your idea wasn''t sound, when i saw this shot i thought of another one where the parent is passing the car key to the teenager as he heads out the door on a date...not sure how hard that would have been to set up, if even a possibility, but perhaps a more exotic alternative.', '2005-07-22 00:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554042, 203336, 13688, '<td valign="top">damn paparazo...nice candid.  perhaps some unavoidable grain from enlargement?  i guess his buddy wasn''t that important...unfortunately his moustache got in the way.</td>', 'damn paparazo...nice candid.  perhaps some unavoidable grain from enlargement?  i guess his buddy wasn''t that important...unfortunately his moustache got in the way.', '2005-07-22 00:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554049, 202775, 13688, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors. maybe just too much leg...it feels like you''ve unintentionally cut off her feet...perhaps you had.  i''m thinking cropped right at the knee and this shot would be perfect...but what do i know, i''m sure it will do well as is.  just realized why i really like this shot...the way her arms mimic the sides of the roads...nice work.</td>', 'wonderful colors. maybe just too much leg...it feels like you''ve unintentionally cut off her feet...perhaps you had.  i''m thinking cropped right at the knee and this shot would be perfect...but what do i know, i''m sure it will do well as is.  just realized why i really like this shot...the way her arms mimic the sides of the roads...nice work.', '2005-07-22 00:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554053, 202394, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective.  though not very compositionally appealing for me.  would have been cooler if the star section was shaped more like a heart...it looks more like a clog or the outline of one of those goldfish snack crackers.  you seem to have some coloring problems in the upper right and under the stars...kind of curious what caused that.</td>', 'interesting perspective.  though not very compositionally appealing for me.  would have been cooler if the star section was shaped more like a heart...it looks more like a clog or the outline of one of those goldfish snack crackers.  you seem to have some coloring problems in the upper right and under the stars...kind of curious what caused that.', '2005-07-22 00:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554062, 204858, 41099, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo</td>', 'Beautiful photo', '2005-07-22 00:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554069, 204631, 13688, '<td valign="top">good showing of independence.  though it has a snapshot feel to me.  wonder if there was a way to get another angle where perhaps there was just his silouhette in the window for a bit more artistic impression.  just thought how it would have been cool to have him walking up to the front door with a briefcase like he was coming home from work...i know i''ll stop now.</td>', 'good showing of independence.  though it has a snapshot feel to me.  wonder if there was a way to get another angle where perhaps there was just his silouhette in the window for a bit more artistic impression.  just thought how it would have been cool to have him walking up to the front door with a briefcase like he was coming home from work...i know i''ll stop now.', '2005-07-22 00:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554071, 202575, 34547, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer for a greater depth of field but maybe it is safer to stay where you were. The reference in your title is good and the low angle of light adds some nice dimension. Overall, framed well with nice curves. Nice job.</td>', 'I''d prefer for a greater depth of field but maybe it is safer to stay where you were. The reference in your title is good and the low angle of light adds some nice dimension. Overall, framed well with nice curves. Nice job.', '2005-07-22 00:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554153, 204561, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the idea of the old tree.  i think your composition only went half way.  i could see things working if you juxaposed it against those brand new homes as a way of showing it wouldn''t go away or showing it alone with the other old building, but not doing both.</td>', 'i like the idea of the old tree.  i think your composition only went half way.  i could see things working if you juxaposed it against those brand new homes as a way of showing it wouldn''t go away or showing it alone with the other old building, but not doing both.', '2005-07-22 01:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554161, 204670, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice capture of a show of strength.  great exposure in direct sunlight.  the composition feels off to me with the piece of the wing missing on the left and then all that room on the right</td>', 'nice capture of a show of strength.  great exposure in direct sunlight.  the composition feels off to me with the piece of the wing missing on the left and then all that room on the right', '2005-07-22 01:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554172, 203477, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting angle.  possibly more interesting as a series of shots as the flag blown around at different angles.  if you had to choose 1 point of view, i would have liked to seen 1 with more of the stars showing.</td>', 'interesting angle.  possibly more interesting as a series of shots as the flag blown around at different angles.  if you had to choose 1 point of view, i would have liked to seen 1 with more of the stars showing.', '2005-07-22 01:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554174, 202730, 30822, '<td valign="top">Don''t usually score nudes well but this is nicely done. Exp., pose, etc. really like the angle. 9.</td>', 'Don''t usually score nudes well but this is nicely done. Exp., pose, etc. really like the angle. 9.', '2005-07-22 01:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554181, 204845, 13688, '<td valign="top">cool pan technique.  like the colors.  her expression and her closed shoulders make her seem like she is holding on for dear life.  if possible having her head back and smiling would have added to the feeling of independence for me</td>', 'cool pan technique.  like the colors.  her expression and her closed shoulders make her seem like she is holding on for dear life.  if possible having her head back and smiling would have added to the feeling of independence for me', '2005-07-22 01:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554196, 203400, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m a bit confused as to your intent.  armed patrols doesn''t scream independence to me.  quality wise you had some tough conditions to work with...strong sun and choppy water.  the foam and lettering are a bit blown out so you could have done well to stop down (if possible)  this smaller aperture may have also helped improve your slight fuzziness.</td>', 'i''m a bit confused as to your intent.  armed patrols doesn''t scream independence to me.  quality wise you had some tough conditions to work with...strong sun and choppy water.  the foam and lettering are a bit blown out so you could have done well to stop down (if possible)  this smaller aperture may have also helped improve your slight fuzziness.', '2005-07-22 01:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554205, 204862, 13688, '<td valign="top">outstanding tones for a basic editing challenge.  i wish that crest wasn''t there, but oh well.  great job with the exposure.</td>', 'outstanding tones for a basic editing challenge.  i wish that crest wasn''t there, but oh well.  great job with the exposure.', '2005-07-22 01:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554212, 204419, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice pic.  just a tad soft on the focus. i really like the mountains as the backdrop to add to it''s airyness.  i wish the bush wasn''t there, perhaps it was impossible to get an angle without it.</td>', 'nice pic.  just a tad soft on the focus. i really like the mountains as the backdrop to add to it''s airyness.  i wish the bush wasn''t there, perhaps it was impossible to get an angle without it.', '2005-07-22 01:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554219, 204855, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  great detail.  i wish the clouds didn''t look so odd.  what ever they''re doing is very distracting</td>', 'nice composition.  great detail.  i wish the clouds didn''t look so odd.  what ever they''re doing is very distracting', '2005-07-22 01:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554244, 204164, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice.  A grownup interpretation of independence; flags may wave and golden eagles may soar, but the one real and lasting font of independence is from within ... self knowledge.  This is a great visualisation of this eternal truth.  10</td>', 'Nice.  A grownup interpretation of independence; flags may wave and golden eagles may soar, but the one real and lasting font of independence is from within ... self knowledge.  This is a great visualisation of this eternal truth.  10', '2005-07-22 02:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554245, 202165, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely ephemeral feel to this scene &amp; it works so well with your excellent title, especially since any tracks made here are soon washed away (ephemeral again!)  Very nice composition, processed with restraint and maturity.  9</td>', 'Lovely ephemeral feel to this scene & it works so well with your excellent title, especially since any tracks made here are soon washed away (ephemeral again!)  Very nice composition, processed with restraint and maturity.  9', '2005-07-22 02:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554246, 204618, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image which illustrates the price of freedom in that before the spirit rises the body must first be tamed and subjugated to the higher self. The image requires a slittle study to appreciate the double exposure value, however, the prostrate image invites the looker into the image. I am very impressed.</td>', 'A very nice image which illustrates the price of freedom in that before the spirit rises the body must first be tamed and subjugated to the higher self. The image requires a slittle study to appreciate the double exposure value, however, the prostrate image invites the looker into the image. I am very impressed.', '2005-07-22 02:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554248, 202753, 30364, '<td valign="top">My favourite among the "car keys" shots.  I remember my similar moment only too well ... a woman ran into the back of dad''s car at a stoplight!  This is a nice composition, perfect DOF for the purpose.  Good job.  8</td>', 'My favourite among the "car keys" shots.  I remember my similar moment only too well ... a woman ran into the back of dad''s car at a stoplight!  This is a nice composition, perfect DOF for the purpose.  Good job.  8', '2005-07-22 02:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554253, 203814, 30364, '<td valign="top">Outstanding depiction of a child''s tentative discovery of independence.  The ankle deep exploration, the slightly giddy pose, and the thoughtful composition (shallows below the diagonal &amp; the deep above), make this an effective metaphoric as well as literal  depiction of independence.  9</td>', 'Outstanding depiction of a child''s tentative discovery of independence.  The ankle deep exploration, the slightly giddy pose, and the thoughtful composition (shallows below the diagonal & the deep above), make this an effective metaphoric as well as literal  depiction of independence.  9', '2005-07-22 02:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554257, 203653, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  You''re going to get some "pity about the chain" comments, I guess.  But of course it is the presence &amp; placement of that chain (especially in relation to the eye) that lifts this image from the merely good to the excellent.  If you also receive any "pity about the bit of stuff stuck in her hair" comments, don''t scream ... smile.  7</td>', 'This is interesting.  You''re going to get some "pity about the chain" comments, I guess.  But of course it is the presence & placement of that chain (especially in relation to the eye) that lifts this image from the merely good to the excellent.  If you also receive any "pity about the bit of stuff stuck in her hair" comments, don''t scream ... smile.  7', '2005-07-22 02:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554262, 202314, 30364, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not the most artistically breathtaking image, but it''s the perfect depiction of the challenge topic.  This little guy looks exactly like he is nervously contemplating a first step that will change his life forever.  Well spotted and well photographed.  7</td>', 'Perhaps not the most artistically breathtaking image, but it''s the perfect depiction of the challenge topic.  This little guy looks exactly like he is nervously contemplating a first step that will change his life forever.  Well spotted and well photographed.  7', '2005-07-22 02:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554265, 203866, 30364, '<td valign="top">Unusual and effective surfing scene, mainly due to the interesting surface he''s walking on (is it a breakwall of some kind?).  The silhouette of the surfer looks good against the sparkling detail of the ocean, especially as the rail of the surfboard has caught some light, which gives better definition to both the board and the surfer.  And the solitary seabird is also very good.  8</td>', 'Unusual and effective surfing scene, mainly due to the interesting surface he''s walking on (is it a breakwall of some kind?).  The silhouette of the surfer looks good against the sparkling detail of the ocean, especially as the rail of the surfboard has caught some light, which gives better definition to both the board and the surfer.  And the solitary seabird is also very good.  8', '2005-07-22 02:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554331, 204659, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I particularly like the texturing on the shirt and shorts. Great light on his face. 8</td>', 'Nice capture. I particularly like the texturing on the shirt and shorts. Great light on his face. 8', '2005-07-22 04:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554332, 202432, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice sentiment and idea. The cropping is a bit of an issue for me, with the background feels cluttered, given the cropped off men at the right and left upper corners.</td>', 'Nice sentiment and idea. The cropping is a bit of an issue for me, with the background feels cluttered, given the cropped off men at the right and left upper corners.', '2005-07-22 04:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554335, 204817, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but my screen is registering strong purplish hues on the sky and water, and the person''s clothing.</td>', 'I like this shot, but my screen is registering strong purplish hues on the sky and water, and the person''s clothing.', '2005-07-22 04:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554336, 204432, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but horizon slightly skewed.</td>', 'Nice shot, but horizon slightly skewed.', '2005-07-22 04:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554337, 204739, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but the background feels cluttered.6</td>', 'nice shot, but the background feels cluttered.6', '2005-07-22 04:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554340, 204756, 34247, '<td valign="top">This shot feels familiar to me. I like the slanting shadow line and the color treatment. The textured background brings the image to life. The guy with the belly is a nice touch, and provides a good juxtaposition to the promise of youth embodied by the young girl. Your titling is nicely cheeky as well. For me, this is a 9.</td>', 'This shot feels familiar to me. I like the slanting shadow line and the color treatment. The textured background brings the image to life. The guy with the belly is a nice touch, and provides a good juxtaposition to the promise of youth embodied by the young girl. Your titling is nicely cheeky as well. For me, this is a 9.', '2005-07-22 04:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554392, 204817, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like fishing shots, and they do so often convey the fisherman''s self-contained world (thus independence, I guess, although to me it''s more a feeling of solitude).  This is a beautiful scene and accurately conveys the velvet quiet of approaching evening ... very evocative.  My only disappointment here is that the fisherman is perhaps a little too distant, and thus not prominent enough to justify his titular status.  But I still love the feel of this image.  7</td>', 'I like fishing shots, and they do so often convey the fisherman''s self-contained world (thus independence, I guess, although to me it''s more a feeling of solitude).  This is a beautiful scene and accurately conveys the velvet quiet of approaching evening ... very evocative.  My only disappointment here is that the fisherman is perhaps a little too distant, and thus not prominent enough to justify his titular status.  But I still love the feel of this image.  7', '2005-07-22 06:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554401, 204787, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this photograph except the subject.  Is it just a stick, or am I missing something?  It is indeed "standing alone", but that in itself doesn''t say anything about independence to me.  Nevertheless, it''s a very fine photograph of a most interesting scene (not counting the stick), and very stylishly processed as well.  7</td>', 'I like everything about this photograph except the subject.  Is it just a stick, or am I missing something?  It is indeed "standing alone", but that in itself doesn''t say anything about independence to me.  Nevertheless, it''s a very fine photograph of a most interesting scene (not counting the stick), and very stylishly processed as well.  7', '2005-07-22 07:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554415, 204001, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess I''ll be unpopular because while I think this image will probably win you a ribbon, I don''t much like it.  Not because it''s a poor photograph; it''s technically very good, and the composition, indeed the whole execution, is visually striking.  Moreover, your idea will have universal appeal as a depiction of independence; very dramatic and theatrical.  My problem is that it seems too contrived and obvious; the sort of image an advertising agency would come up with ... a two-syllable photograph for an audience with limited vocabulary.  I apologise in advance if you think my views insulting, especially as this is obviously a work of a highly competent photographer.  5</td>', 'Well, I guess I''ll be unpopular because while I think this image will probably win you a ribbon, I don''t much like it.  Not because it''s a poor photograph; it''s technically very good, and the composition, indeed the whole execution, is visually striking.  Moreover, your idea will have universal appeal as a depiction of independence; very dramatic and theatrical.  My problem is that it seems too contrived and obvious; the sort of image an advertising agency would come up with ... a two-syllable photograph for an audience with limited vocabulary.  I apologise in advance if you think my views insulting, especially as this is obviously a work of a highly competent photographer.  5', '2005-07-22 07:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554481, 202165, 32754, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light and mood...I like the breaking waves and placement of subjects.</td>', 'Nice use of light and mood...I like the breaking waves and placement of subjects.', '2005-07-22 08:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554484, 204864, 32754, '<td valign="top">good angle and subtle lighting.</td>', 'good angle and subtle lighting.', '2005-07-22 09:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554486, 202394, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like the effect created here by the rippling in flag.</td>', 'I like the effect created here by the rippling in flag.', '2005-07-22 09:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554556, 204559, 41112, '<td valign="top">amazing</td>', 'amazing', '2005-07-22 09:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554567, 204608, 30364, '<td valign="top">Remarkable photograph ... it is so unusual and graphically spare that it actually looks fake (I know it''s not).  I imagine it will rate very highly in the voting, and I will look forward to your revealing exactly what is happening here.  I found it fascinating, but somehow a tiny bit too two-dimensional to make any serious impression on me.  Hope I haven''t offended you too much!  6</td>', 'Remarkable photograph ... it is so unusual and graphically spare that it actually looks fake (I know it''s not).  I imagine it will rate very highly in the voting, and I will look forward to your revealing exactly what is happening here.  I found it fascinating, but somehow a tiny bit too two-dimensional to make any serious impression on me.  Hope I haven''t offended you too much!  6', '2005-07-22 09:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554690, 204028, 33672, '<td valign="top">Would''ve made a good fantasy world entry! ;)</td>', 'Would''ve made a good fantasy world entry! ;)', '2005-07-22 11:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554693, 202058, 33672, '<td valign="top">I''ve had days like this.  Great Idea but many probably won''t make the connection to the theme.  Great comp and an interesting DOF.</td>', 'I''ve had days like this.  Great Idea but many probably won''t make the connection to the theme.  Great comp and an interesting DOF.', '2005-07-22 11:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554705, 204858, 24764, '<td valign="top">Great imagination. Wonderfully put and portrayed. Must be in the top five.</td>', 'Great imagination. Wonderfully put and portrayed. Must be in the top five.', '2005-07-22 11:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554708, 204635, 24764, '<td valign="top">Great sense of humour. Nice Picture</td>', 'Great sense of humour. Nice Picture', '2005-07-22 11:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554836, 202730, 34217, '<td valign="top">I love fine art nudes and shoot a lot of them, but this one doesn''t feel "arty" to me.  I think it is hard to please people when it comes to this subject matter.  Because I am a woman, I look at nudes much differently than a man would.  The shoes make it feel "playboyish" it me.  And keep in mind this is totally a personal preference.  I aslo think her pose gives the same feel.  It could be that this is what you are going for and if so great.  I like to see nudes be about shape and form and the beauty of the human body and less about sexy.  However, I think many people on the site are offended that someof us choose to shoot nudes and I think that it is great that you shoot what you want.  Keep at it!</td>', 'I love fine art nudes and shoot a lot of them, but this one doesn''t feel "arty" to me.  I think it is hard to please people when it comes to this subject matter.  Because I am a woman, I look at nudes much differently than a man would.  The shoes make it feel "playboyish" it me.  And keep in mind this is totally a personal preference.  I aslo think her pose gives the same feel.  It could be that this is what you are going for and if so great.  I like to see nudes be about shape and form and the beauty of the human body and less about sexy.  However, I think many people on the site are offended that someof us choose to shoot nudes and I think that it is great that you shoot what you want.  Keep at it!', '2005-07-22 12:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554841, 204488, 34217, '<td valign="top">This could have been really cool, but your lighting leaves a little to be desired.  Instead of using an on camera flash, use side light to bring this subject to life.</td>', 'This could have been really cool, but your lighting leaves a little to be desired.  Instead of using an on camera flash, use side light to bring this subject to life.', '2005-07-22 12:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554844, 203336, 34217, '<td valign="top">this guy looks like jay leno!</td>', 'this guy looks like jay leno!', '2005-07-22 12:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554899, 204024, 20066, '<td valign="top">I like this very much</td>', 'I like this very much', '2005-07-22 13:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554910, 204864, 27789, '<td valign="top">i love the angle on this.  i wish there was more light on this side of the ship, but that was probably out of your control.</td>', 'i love the angle on this.  i wish there was more light on this side of the ship, but that was probably out of your control.', '2005-07-22 13:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554917, 204468, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like the background, and it''s contrast with your subject</td>', 'i like the background, and it''s contrast with your subject', '2005-07-22 13:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554922, 203653, 27789, '<td valign="top">i don''t understand the title, but like the photo, especially the chain in front of her face.  the lighting is nice, and the contrast as well.</td>', 'i don''t understand the title, but like the photo, especially the chain in front of her face.  the lighting is nice, and the contrast as well.', '2005-07-22 13:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554967, 204658, 27789, '<td valign="top">indistinguishable foreground, blown-out background, too much contrast, centered subject with words growing out of his head, i like it.  9</td>', 'indistinguishable foreground, blown-out background, too much contrast, centered subject with words growing out of his head, i like it.  9', '2005-07-22 13:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1554977, 204164, 27789, '<td valign="top">well executed.  on the lighting i just wish the eye in the center had more light on it.</td>', 'well executed.  on the lighting i just wish the eye in the center had more light on it.', '2005-07-22 13:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555054, 203362, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like the colors in the background, but the lack of detail in the dragonfly hurts the picture, in my opinion.</td>', 'i like the colors in the background, but the lack of detail in the dragonfly hurts the picture, in my opinion.', '2005-07-22 14:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555058, 204832, 27789, '<td valign="top">nice macro.  i even like the border which normally i''m not a fan of.</td>', 'nice macro.  i even like the border which normally i''m not a fan of.', '2005-07-22 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555061, 202730, 27789, '<td valign="top">the title/subject matter works well.  i''m just not sure about the setting, an open window, though i do like the strong backlight.</td>', 'the title/subject matter works well.  i''m just not sure about the setting, an open window, though i do like the strong backlight.', '2005-07-22 14:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555066, 203478, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like the shot, but don''t necessarily think b&amp;w is right for it.  all of the trees, grass, and flowers just blend together as they''re all about the same tone.  and the blown out sky doesn''t help a lot.  the truck looks nice in b&amp;w though.</td>', 'i like the shot, but don''t necessarily think b&w is right for it.  all of the trees, grass, and flowers just blend together as they''re all about the same tone.  and the blown out sky doesn''t help a lot.  the truck looks nice in b&w though.', '2005-07-22 14:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555096, 202768, 27789, '<td valign="top">the high contrast is good, though maybe just a bit too much.  it''s a nice candid, i especially like the guy in the back with the coffee.</td>', 'the high contrast is good, though maybe just a bit too much.  it''s a nice candid, i especially like the guy in the back with the coffee.', '2005-07-22 14:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555242, 204164, 41123, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, if done optically...</td>', 'Interesting effect, if done optically...', '2005-07-22 15:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555262, 204883, 27789, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  the shot works well, though i''m not a big fan of the leaf at the top of the frame.</td>', 'nice idea.  the shot works well, though i''m not a big fan of the leaf at the top of the frame.', '2005-07-22 15:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555277, 203731, 29011, '<td valign="top">An amazing stop action photo!</td>', 'An amazing stop action photo!', '2005-07-22 15:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555552, 204522, 35739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.', '2005-07-22 17:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555570, 204524, 3087, '<td valign="top">Surely if it''s too young for independence it''s conveying the exact opposite of independence, no?</td>', 'Surely if it''s too young for independence it''s conveying the exact opposite of independence, no?', '2005-07-22 17:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555574, 204479, 29474, '<td valign="top">It is a pity that the image is so small.</td>', 'It is a pity that the image is so small.', '2005-07-22 17:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555606, 204559, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning photograph. But I don''t see a link to the challenge topic.</td>', 'This is a stunning photograph. But I don''t see a link to the challenge topic.', '2005-07-22 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555609, 202167, 3087, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7. I like the black and white nature and the extreme shallow DOF. Just because I''m fortunate enough not to have been through this I can still understand how aspects of the psychological rollercoaster of relationship breakdown can feel like regaining an independence of sorts. I think it''s a brave and personal picture and a very valid interpretation.</td>', 'I gave this a 7. I like the black and white nature and the extreme shallow DOF. Just because I''m fortunate enough not to have been through this I can still understand how aspects of the psychological rollercoaster of relationship breakdown can feel like regaining an independence of sorts. I think it''s a brave and personal picture and a very valid interpretation.', '2005-07-22 18:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555637, 204864, 35161, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Maybe just a bit more space on the left...<br/>Very well captured! :)</td>', 'Great shot! Maybe just a bit more space on the left...Very well captured! :)', '2005-07-22 18:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555662, 204001, 3087, '<td valign="top">Stunning, absolutely stunning.<br/>Whilst one could argue that this photo is all about oppression I choose to interpret it as someone breaking free of that oppression and gaining their independence. <br/>The way the lower expanse of sky merges blackly into the lower area of the silhouette is very clever. So too is the echo between the red of the sun, backed by black and the red of the sky. A very clever use of colour processing. <br/>Wonderful composition - the off-centred arms and sun couldn''t be better positioned within the frame and to each other.<br/>TOP SHOT!<br/>10!</td>', 'Stunning, absolutely stunning.Whilst one could argue that this photo is all about oppression I choose to interpret it as someone breaking free of that oppression and gaining their independence. The way the lower expanse of sky merges blackly into the lower area of the silhouette is very clever. So too is the echo between the red of the sun, backed by black and the red of the sky. A very clever use of colour processing. Wonderful composition - the off-centred arms and sun couldn''t be better positioned within the frame and to each other.TOP SHOT!10!', '2005-07-22 18:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555665, 204078, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured though the all black background feels kind of strange - don''t they feed only in the day? Still, a beautiful shot and that effortless flight does convey independence to me. 8</td>', 'Beautifully captured though the all black background feels kind of strange - don''t they feed only in the day? Still, a beautiful shot and that effortless flight does convey independence to me. 8', '2005-07-22 18:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555688, 204608, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, lovely lines, lovely light and shade shapes, great detail, nice limited colour palette and the abseiler (?) makes a great focal point. 9</td>', 'Wonderful image, lovely lines, lovely light and shade shapes, great detail, nice limited colour palette and the abseiler (?) makes a great focal point. 9', '2005-07-22 18:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555696, 204776, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image that represents a range of related concepts so simply and minimally. I find it a touch dark towards the left side of the frame and the crop at the top a touch tight (if that''s to exclude unwanted objects perhaps cropping tighter still might strangely make it feel less tightly cropped?) but overall I think it''s lovely. 8</td>', 'Wonderful image that represents a range of related concepts so simply and minimally. I find it a touch dark towards the left side of the frame and the crop at the top a touch tight (if that''s to exclude unwanted objects perhaps cropping tighter still might strangely make it feel less tightly cropped?) but overall I think it''s lovely. 8', '2005-07-22 18:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555708, 204814, 3087, '<td valign="top">Intriguing, especially with her face hidden in the shadow ... yet that works as it makes it more anonymous and therefore more universal. I like the diagonal and the unusual lighting. 8</td>', 'Intriguing, especially with her face hidden in the shadow ... yet that works as it makes it more anonymous and therefore more universal. I like the diagonal and the unusual lighting. 8', '2005-07-22 18:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555713, 204479, 35739, '<td valign="top">Probaby a nice photo.  Hard to see the details due to its size.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Probaby a nice photo.  Hard to see the details due to its size. ', '2005-07-22 18:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555716, 204635, 3087, '<td valign="top">Toooo funny... I think this is very well done. Annoyingly (because I don''t want to nitpick) my eye keeps getting pulled to the dark beans at the bottom left corner and that darkness kind of weighs down in the corner of my eye even when I focus elsewhere. Still an 8 though!</td>', 'Toooo funny... I think this is very well done. Annoyingly (because I don''t want to nitpick) my eye keeps getting pulled to the dark beans at the bottom left corner and that darkness kind of weighs down in the corner of my eye even when I focus elsewhere. Still an 8 though!', '2005-07-22 18:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555717, 204036, 3087, '<td valign="top">A particularly appealing cloudscape with lovely shapes, a pleasing composition, some nice shades of grey and blue and a nice clean feel. 8</td>', 'A particularly appealing cloudscape with lovely shapes, a pleasing composition, some nice shades of grey and blue and a nice clean feel. 8', '2005-07-22 18:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555719, 203814, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful image with nice composition, perfect exposure and a great connection to the challenge topic. Outstanding in every way.</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful image with nice composition, perfect exposure and a great connection to the challenge topic. Outstanding in every way.', '2005-07-22 18:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555721, 204845, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love this. It''s so utterly about the theme to me - it resonates with how I like to see myself and my outlook on life. The motion blur and colours are great as is the light on her face and arms and the composition. 9</td>', 'Love this. It''s so utterly about the theme to me - it resonates with how I like to see myself and my outlook on life. The motion blur and colours are great as is the light on her face and arms and the composition. 9', '2005-07-22 18:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555731, 204858, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I really like the way the clouds and areas of sky create such strong leadig lines. I like the silhouette of the photographer and the way he is against the white cloud rather than blue sky. I like the detail and colour in the foreground brash ice. I like the edge formed by the dark gravel/ pebbles and how it''s echoed by the sky getting darker at the top. I also identify with how this relates to the theme as it reminds me of the thrill of taking images on a recent dream trip to Antarctica. Great shot. 9</td>', 'Excellent shot. I really like the way the clouds and areas of sky create such strong leadig lines. I like the silhouette of the photographer and the way he is against the white cloud rather than blue sky. I like the detail and colour in the foreground brash ice. I like the edge formed by the dark gravel/ pebbles and how it''s echoed by the sky getting darker at the top. I also identify with how this relates to the theme as it reminds me of the thrill of taking images on a recent dream trip to Antarctica. Great shot. 9', '2005-07-22 18:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555736, 202165, 3087, '<td valign="top">Grain and black and white adds to mood. Nice element of serenity and escape. 8</td>', 'Grain and black and white adds to mood. Nice element of serenity and escape. 8', '2005-07-22 18:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555739, 202775, 3087, '<td valign="top">At first glance, oh another kid, but oh what a compelling portrait. I just can''t look away. There''s some kind of connection in that eye contact and the pose and coloured dress against the muted colours of the long path behind all combine to make this pop out at me. 8</td>', 'At first glance, oh another kid, but oh what a compelling portrait. I just can''t look away. There''s some kind of connection in that eye contact and the pose and coloured dress against the muted colours of the long path behind all combine to make this pop out at me. 8', '2005-07-22 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1555745, 204798, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lines which are emphasised by the greyscaling but I find the tone colour far too yellowey. Great subject choice - works well. 8</td>', 'Nice lines which are emphasised by the greyscaling but I find the tone colour far too yellowey. Great subject choice - works well. 8', '2005-07-22 18:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555753, 204024, 3087, '<td valign="top">With the exception of the lack of detail in the sky I really like this a whole lot. I love the fact that these two individuals are sitting together - like an intimate escape together from the rest of the world. It reminds me of travelling (which I adore) and of romance (which I adore too) and of the beauty of the earth (oh yes, I adore that too). Nice in black and white. 8</td>', 'With the exception of the lack of detail in the sky I really like this a whole lot. I love the fact that these two individuals are sitting together - like an intimate escape together from the rest of the world. It reminds me of travelling (which I adore) and of romance (which I adore too) and of the beauty of the earth (oh yes, I adore that too). Nice in black and white. 8', '2005-07-22 19:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555766, 202058, 3087, '<td valign="top">Just love this. Incredible how much you can convey with such a simple and everyday pair of items. Nicely composed. Plain white background works quite well. Like the sharpnes of detail on the mud on the front toe but blurriness everywhere else. That lace laying to the right just makes the composition. 9</td>', 'Just love this. Incredible how much you can convey with such a simple and everyday pair of items. Nicely composed. Plain white background works quite well. Like the sharpnes of detail on the mud on the front toe but blurriness everywhere else. That lace laying to the right just makes the composition. 9', '2005-07-22 19:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555769, 203362, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great composition, wonderful contrast of dragonfly colours and background colours. Wish it were a touch sharper though I can understand why that might not be the case. Flight definitely speaks of independence to me. 8</td>', 'Great composition, wonderful contrast of dragonfly colours and background colours. Wish it were a touch sharper though I can understand why that might not be the case. Flight definitely speaks of independence to me. 8', '2005-07-22 19:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555832, 202165, 5354, '<td valign="top">Blue ribbon from me - the full 10 points.<br/>So dreamy, so moody and sooo well composed</td>', 'Blue ribbon from me - the full 10 points.So dreamy, so moody and sooo well composed', '2005-07-22 19:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555835, 204608, 5354, '<td valign="top">Thats an amazing image, and I love how you managed to get the guy in the lighter background. Brilliant - 9</td>', 'Thats an amazing image, and I love how you managed to get the guy in the lighter background. Brilliant - 9', '2005-07-22 20:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555856, 204044, 5354, '<td valign="top">OK so why is this going to bomb?<br/>Well for me there is nothing here which makes me want to stop and look at it for more than about half a second. Its such a literal representation of the challenge theme without any attempt to give it any zap or wow factor.<br/> <br/>DPC is not just about meeting the challenge, its about doing it with some style, some attempt at art. Try some different lighting, try a few gimmicks, experiment, learn and enjoy. My guess is this tokk about 3 minutes to set up and shoot, which is why your voters will take a proportionate amount of time to dismiss it.<br/> <br/></td>', 'OK so why is this going to bomb?Well for me there is nothing here which makes me want to stop and look at it for more than about half a second. Its such a literal representation of the challenge theme without any attempt to give it any zap or wow factor. DPC is not just about meeting the challenge, its about doing it with some style, some attempt at art. Try some different lighting, try a few gimmicks, experiment, learn and enjoy. My guess is this tokk about 3 minutes to set up and shoot, which is why your voters will take a proportionate amount of time to dismiss it. ', '2005-07-22 20:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1555862, 204882, 5354, '<td valign="top">In my experience toys, ornaments, flags and soft focus tend not to go down well at DPC. Unfortunately you have a fair number of these elements in your image.</td>', 'In my experience toys, ornaments, flags and soft focus tend not to go down well at DPC. Unfortunately you have a fair number of these elements in your image.', '2005-07-22 20:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
