(1556234, 203477, 33392, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you had to play with the colors to darken the blue.  In any case, I''m giving you credit for that, because it makes the picture.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m guessing you had to play with the colors to darken the blue.  In any case, I''m giving you credit for that, because it makes the picture.  Well done.', '2005-07-22 23:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
