(1556246, 204078, 33392, '<td valign="top">I don''t think  I have ever seen a hummingbird on a black background like this.  Looks like a flash capture at night.  Great details.</td>', 'I don''t think  I have ever seen a hummingbird on a black background like this.  Looks like a flash capture at night.  Great details.', '2005-07-23 00:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556248, 204813, 33392, '<td valign="top">The whites are very blue.  I don''t know if that was intentional, but I don''t think it helps the picture very much.  Nice concept.</td>', 'The whites are very blue.  I don''t know if that was intentional, but I don''t think it helps the picture very much.  Nice concept.', '2005-07-23 00:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
