(1556252, 202167, 33392, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting interpretations of independence.  The ring more in the foreground is so out-of-focus that it is distracting.  DOF with these macro shots are always a challenge.</td>', 'One of the more interesting interpretations of independence.  The ring more in the foreground is so out-of-focus that it is distracting.  DOF with these macro shots are always a challenge.', '2005-07-23 00:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
