(1556255, 204787, 33392, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that the pole (whatever it is) is lost in this photo.  I really can''t tell what it is, so I think I am missing the point you are trying to make.</td>', 'I have to admit that the pole (whatever it is) is lost in this photo.  I really can''t tell what it is, so I think I am missing the point you are trying to make.', '2005-07-23 00:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
