(1556258, 203808, 33392, '<td valign="top">Try to bounce the flash off the ceiling next time.  The lighting is pretty harsh.  I like the red hair - you are going to have your hands full!</td>', 'Try to bounce the flash off the ceiling next time.  The lighting is pretty harsh.  I like the red hair - you are going to have your hands full!', '2005-07-23 00:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
