(1556262, 203814, 33392, '<td valign="top">Most of the children photos in this challenge are just snapshots.  This one is well composed, and the lighting really adds to the photo.  The subject is not just the child, but her interaction with her surroundings.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Most of the children photos in this challenge are just snapshots.  This one is well composed, and the lighting really adds to the photo.  The subject is not just the child, but her interaction with her surroundings.  Keep up the good work.', '2005-07-23 00:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556265, 203950, 33392, '<td valign="top">I really don''t get the fit that this has with the "independence" theme, but it''s an apealing photo.  The red background is a good choice.  Wish the artwork was a bit sharper in focus, but otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I really don''t get the fit that this has with the "independence" theme, but it''s an apealing photo.  The red background is a good choice.  Wish the artwork was a bit sharper in focus, but otherwise a nice shot.', '2005-07-23 00:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556268, 204889, 33392, '<td valign="top">crisp capture of high-paced action.  But this is independence how?</td>', 'crisp capture of high-paced action.  But this is independence how?', '2005-07-23 00:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556269, 203495, 2170, '<td valign="top">this is a great portrait.  the expression really says a lot.</td>', 'this is a great portrait.  the expression really says a lot.', '2005-07-23 00:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556271, 202588, 30881, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image. The right lighting, great color, and fantastic sharpnexx/texture,<br/>however if I didn''t look at the titly or category it wouldn''t make me think of independence.<br/>Its still worthy of a "10". Great craftsmanship. Congrats.</td>', 'This is an excellent image. The right lighting, great color, and fantastic sharpnexx/texture,however if I didn''t look at the titly or category it wouldn''t make me think of independence.Its still worthy of a "10". Great craftsmanship. Congrats.', '2005-07-23 00:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556275, 202165, 33392, '<td valign="top">I really wish this were sharper, becuase it would be fantastic.  It seems very grainy (which you may very well have been intending to do), but I would like to have seen it in a more crisp rendition.  What waves!</td>', 'I really wish this were sharper, becuase it would be fantastic.  It seems very grainy (which you may very well have been intending to do), but I would like to have seen it in a more crisp rendition.  What waves!', '2005-07-23 00:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556278, 204776, 33392, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The solitude, the colors.  I would like it even more if the footprints were walking away from you, but then again, that would''ve requred you to walk backwards to setup the shot.  I think it would''ve conveyed the concept of independence better though.  Nice shot either way.</td>', 'I like this.  The solitude, the colors.  I would like it even more if the footprints were walking away from you, but then again, that would''ve requred you to walk backwards to setup the shot.  I think it would''ve conveyed the concept of independence better though.  Nice shot either way.', '2005-07-23 00:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556332, 204800, 13688, '<td valign="top">wish the colors were bolder.  maybe could use a bit more contrast for added pop.</td>', 'wish the colors were bolder.  maybe could use a bit more contrast for added pop.', '2005-07-23 00:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556345, 203151, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice focus.  interesting background.  i like how her eyeshadow matches the violet in the bg and draws you around the pic.  i wish the bow wasn''t there or was maybe positioned differently in the frame.</td>', 'nice focus.  interesting background.  i like how her eyeshadow matches the violet in the bg and draws you around the pic.  i wish the bow wasn''t there or was maybe positioned differently in the frame.', '2005-07-23 01:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556356, 204619, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the fill on his face but the shadow it created, shows it to be probably more than you needed.  i would have tightened that aperture if possible to help with the blown out bg.  interesting subject and nice composition.  pro border.</td>', 'i like the fill on his face but the shadow it created, shows it to be probably more than you needed.  i would have tightened that aperture if possible to help with the blown out bg.  interesting subject and nice composition.  pro border.', '2005-07-23 01:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1556365, 204043, 13688, '<td valign="top">good idea.  i think for a true silhouette you might have looked at other possible compositions if you had the time or other subjects rolling through.  it just seems misbalanced to me.  and i''m not sure the boat and tree add any interest to the shot.</td>', 'good idea.  i think for a true silhouette you might have looked at other possible compositions if you had the time or other subjects rolling through.  it just seems misbalanced to me.  and i''m not sure the boat and tree add any interest to the shot.', '2005-07-23 01:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
