(1557831, 204488, 36231, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge.  Most people thought of their kids ... very few would recognize that the elderly seek a return of their independence.  I like that the hand shows the age of your subject, while the top of the cane portrays the ability to get out on their own.  I hope more people recognize the symbolism in this photo. Great work! :)</td>', 'Great take on the challenge.  Most people thought of their kids ... very few would recognize that the elderly seek a return of their independence.  I like that the hand shows the age of your subject, while the top of the cane portrays the ability to get out on their own.  I hope more people recognize the symbolism in this photo. Great work! :)', '2005-07-23 20:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557848, 204850, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle lighting on the far rocks.</td>', 'I like the subtle lighting on the far rocks.', '2005-07-23 21:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557850, 203783, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice shot--I''ve been trying to get a good shot of some window-washers for a while now.</td>', 'Nice shot--I''ve been trying to get a good shot of some window-washers for a while now.', '2005-07-23 21:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557864, 204868, 34906, '<td valign="top">I can feel the spray.  Super capture.  I rated this number one.</td>', 'I can feel the spray.  Super capture.  I rated this number one.', '2005-07-23 21:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557874, 204028, 1031, '<td valign="top">If only ...</td>', 'If only ...', '2005-07-23 21:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
