(1557937, 204036, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lot of freedom up here where the air is theinner. Nice work.</td>', 'A lot of freedom up here where the air is theinner. Nice work.', '2005-07-23 22:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557940, 204718, 22734, '<td valign="top">What lovely patterns.</td>', 'What lovely patterns.', '2005-07-23 22:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1557945, 202314, 22734, '<td valign="top">Best to wait for mamma. lol A real cutie.</td>', 'Best to wait for mamma. lol A real cutie.', '2005-07-23 22:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558013, 202730, 37893, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. Not for it''s nudity but more so because it stands out above everyone else because it''s different. A personal preference I guess. I hope the soft focus is intentional. The curves of her body against the geometric forms of the window sash and the trees in the horizon create a sense of struggle. Quite exquisite.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. Not for it''s nudity but more so because it stands out above everyone else because it''s different. A personal preference I guess. I hope the soft focus is intentional. The curves of her body against the geometric forms of the window sash and the trees in the horizon create a sense of struggle. Quite exquisite.', '2005-07-23 23:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558015, 202432, 37893, '<td valign="top">The DOF is great in this photo. I guess it would have been more striking if the kid was mirrored so it seems like he was walking towards the big time ball players. I think that would have been a tremendous impact on this photo. Otherwise, it still gets one of my top votes.</td>', 'The DOF is great in this photo. I guess it would have been more striking if the kid was mirrored so it seems like he was walking towards the big time ball players. I think that would have been a tremendous impact on this photo. Otherwise, it still gets one of my top votes.', '2005-07-23 23:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558018, 203149, 37893, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how this relates to independence but then again it''s all in the intent of the photographer right? What i would like to comment on is the photo itself. It seems like you took this as a reflection against a red hood of a car. The hot spot to the right of the image is a bit distracting and washes out the focus of the viewer. Maybe a little saturation so as the red truly is red and not so much on the lighter shade (it could even be seen as a darker pink). Anyway, I do commend your intent and maybe a few more practices on this technicque and it could just very well be incredibly effective.</td>', 'I am not sure how this relates to independence but then again it''s all in the intent of the photographer right? What i would like to comment on is the photo itself. It seems like you took this as a reflection against a red hood of a car. The hot spot to the right of the image is a bit distracting and washes out the focus of the viewer. Maybe a little saturation so as the red truly is red and not so much on the lighter shade (it could even be seen as a darker pink). Anyway, I do commend your intent and maybe a few more practices on this technicque and it could just very well be incredibly effective.', '2005-07-23 23:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558022, 204832, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this image was a tad too late for a previous challenge. I am not quite sure how this relates to independence. With that aside, theis photo, in itself, is amazing. The reflection of the window against the multiple facets of the fls''s eyes are incredible. A great capture.</td>', 'I think this image was a tad too late for a previous challenge. I am not quite sure how this relates to independence. With that aside, theis photo, in itself, is amazing. The reflection of the window against the multiple facets of the fls''s eyes are incredible. A great capture.', '2005-07-23 23:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558031, 204659, 37893, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. The BW truly brings out the drama and emotion that is carried by the street performer. DOF is perfect. Good job.</td>', 'I like this image a lot. The BW truly brings out the drama and emotion that is carried by the street performer. DOF is perfect. Good job.', '2005-07-23 23:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558033, 204559, 25053, '<td valign="top">I find Eagle pictures to be very amazing and this one is no exception.  Great picture!  One of my favorites!  I wonder how you can get such a great picture.  Out here in Southwest Kansas, I only get to see them in zoos with very tight fences.</td>', 'I find Eagle pictures to be very amazing and this one is no exception.  Great picture!  One of my favorites!  I wonder how you can get such a great picture.  Out here in Southwest Kansas, I only get to see them in zoos with very tight fences.', '2005-07-23 23:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558036, 203884, 25053, '<td valign="top">great picture!!!!  It is amazing how people can get this type of shot.</td>', 'great picture!!!!  It is amazing how people can get this type of shot.', '2005-07-23 23:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558040, 204635, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is a great humorous shot that I had given a good score. Independence is not being afraid to stand on your own and to be different. I think both of those wre captured in this image. DOF is perfectly centered against the green bean. Good job and I wish there were more images such as this out there. I like the fact that it is different and not what you would normally expect when you hear the word Independence.</td>', 'This is a great humorous shot that I had given a good score. Independence is not being afraid to stand on your own and to be different. I think both of those wre captured in this image. DOF is perfectly centered against the green bean. Good job and I wish there were more images such as this out there. I like the fact that it is different and not what you would normally expect when you hear the word Independence.', '2005-07-23 23:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558046, 202768, 25053, '<td valign="top">This is nice photo.  I love the black and white.  Would not have been the same in color!!  GOOD JOB!</td>', 'This is nice photo.  I love the black and white.  Would not have been the same in color!!  GOOD JOB!', '2005-07-24 00:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558049, 204817, 37893, '<td valign="top">i think the levels were a little too overdone for this image. The magenta bleeds into the man''s shirt which i doubt really happens. The image in itself is done very well. The white plastic bag (?) just behind the fisherman is a little distracting against a saturated green. I suggest toning the levels down and this image would be perfect.</td>', 'i think the levels were a little too overdone for this image. The magenta bleeds into the man''s shirt which i doubt really happens. The image in itself is done very well. The white plastic bag (?) just behind the fisherman is a little distracting against a saturated green. I suggest toning the levels down and this image would be perfect.', '2005-07-24 00:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558054, 204756, 25053, '<td valign="top">I personally love the lighting on this photo.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'I personally love the lighting on this photo.  Very nicely done!', '2005-07-24 00:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558124, 204798, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great duotones here. I do like the implied statement here. A little bit harsh on the hot spot on the clouds towards the upper right hand corner. Too bad this was a basic challenge rule. This would be great if these hot spots were burned and dodged. Great image. I scored it a 6 at first but then I looked at the image again and realized what you were trying to convey. A 10 from me.</td>', 'Great duotones here. I do like the implied statement here. A little bit harsh on the hot spot on the clouds towards the upper right hand corner. Too bad this was a basic challenge rule. This would be great if these hot spots were burned and dodged. Great image. I scored it a 6 at first but then I looked at the image again and realized what you were trying to convey. A 10 from me.', '2005-07-24 00:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558127, 204001, 37893, '<td valign="top">Powerful image here. It''s almost as if you''re saying that with the dawn comes a new tomorrow where you can be free. Great catch.</td>', 'Powerful image here. It''s almost as if you''re saying that with the dawn comes a new tomorrow where you can be free. Great catch.', '2005-07-24 00:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1558131, 202066, 30791, '<td valign="top">doesnt meet the challenge....<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>just kidding, this is a great photo, this is one of those cases where low saturation looks good in a photo, im glad you chose to do this<br/>7<br/>i may bump it up when im finished voting<br/>good luck<br/>edit: yeah bumping it up to a 9<br/> <br/>edit: last minute bump to 10</td>', 'doesnt meet the challenge....        just kidding, this is a great photo, this is one of those cases where low saturation looks good in a photo, im glad you chose to do this7i may bump it up when im finished votinggood luckedit: yeah bumping it up to a 9 edit: last minute bump to 10', '2005-07-24 00:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
