(1558233, 204814, 30364, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Curt, on your highest rating image so far.  I''m very pleased to see that several other commentators applauded your quirky but effective use of light in this photograph.  I just took a look at your profile, and I love all of your top three entries; this was not a fluke!  I encourage all other browsers to take a look as well.</td>', 'Congratulations, Curt, on your highest rating image so far.  I''m very pleased to see that several other commentators applauded your quirky but effective use of light in this photograph.  I just took a look at your profile, and I love all of your top three entries; this was not a fluke!  I encourage all other browsers to take a look as well.', '2005-07-24 01:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
