(1558976, 204850, 19936, '<td valign="top">This was a poor effort on my part.  I had this idea for some time but never really got around to going to the location and getting the early morning shot I had envisioned.  Found that I had taken this on my way back from a shot for the textures challenge and decided at the last minute to use it.  Color cast is off, focus is soft (500 mm w/ monopod), and setting is just not that interesting.  I need to stick with not submitting unless I get the shot I want.   <br/> <br/>In any case that you to all who voted and commented.  It all helps.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-24 15:10:00.</i></td>', 'This was a poor effort on my part.  I had this idea for some time but never really got around to going to the location and getting the early morning shot I had envisioned.  Found that I had taken this on my way back from a shot for the textures challenge and decided at the last minute to use it.  Color cast is off, focus is soft (500 mm w/ monopod), and setting is just not that interesting.  I need to stick with not submitting unless I get the shot I want.    In any case that you to all who voted and commented.  It all helps.', '2005-07-24 16:09:12.000000', '2005-07-24 16:10:00.000000', 0),
