(1561130, 204559, 36141, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo and it might say ''Independence'' to all Americans, but being a Dutchie an eagle head is not a symbol of anything, it''s nothing else than just an ''eagle head'' and therefor to me: it didn''t meet the challenge. That''s one of the reasons I decided not to vote at all on this challenge.<br/> <br/>Nevertheless, congrats with the blue ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-25 08:56:56.</i></td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo and it might say ''Independence'' to all Americans, but being a Dutchie an eagle head is not a symbol of anything, it''s nothing else than just an ''eagle head'' and therefor to me: it didn''t meet the challenge. That''s one of the reasons I decided not to vote at all on this challenge. Nevertheless, congrats with the blue ribbon.', '2005-07-25 09:51:49.000000', '2005-07-25 09:56:56.000000', 0),
