(1572706, 202775, 41066, '<td valign="top">The thing that struck me about this picture is the bold colors.  I love the deep orange of the dress, the stark grey of the road and the lush green in the background.</td>', 'The thing that struck me about this picture is the bold colors.  I love the deep orange of the dress, the stark grey of the road and the lush green in the background.', '2005-07-29 22:08:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1572710, 204479, 41066, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph!  I love how the watch towers are in the back and the walls of the buildings frame the shot.  I would like to have seen a bigger picture of this.</td>', 'Nice photograph!  I love how the watch towers are in the back and the walls of the buildings frame the shot.  I would like to have seen a bigger picture of this.', '2005-07-29 22:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1572715, 203783, 41066, '<td valign="top">I love the monochromatic effect of this photograph. The lines of the buiding are bold compared to the soft nature of the sky  I am surprised you didnt get a higher score on this one.</td>', 'I love the monochromatic effect of this photograph. The lines of the buiding are bold compared to the soft nature of the sky  I am surprised you didnt get a higher score on this one.', '2005-07-29 22:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
